            ['start_time' => 348.96, 'end_time' => 350.18, 'target_text' => 'Allah make it easy.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mempermudahkan segala urusan.', 'order' => 93],
            ['start_time' => 350.28, 'end_time' => 353.66, 'target_text' => 'It\'s Scottish water, but masha Allah, it\'s good and it\'s pure and it\'s clean.', 'source_text' => 'Ia air Scotland, namun masya-Allah, ia amat elok, suci dan bersih.', 'order' => 94],
            ['start_time' => 353.76, 'end_time' => 360.62, 'target_text' => 'But look, there was a man who gave water from a well that was not a clean in the sense that, you know, when you get water', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi lihatlah, dahulu ada seorang lelaki yang memberi minum air dari sebuah perigi yang tidaklah bersih dalam erti kata, anda tahu apabila mengambil air', 'order' => 95],
            ['start_time' => 360.72, 'end_time' => 363.9, 'target_text' => 'from a well in your shoe, there is a little bit of dirt in it, right?', 'source_text' => 'dari perigi menggunakan kasut anda, sudah tentu ada sedikit sisa kotoran di dalamnya, bukan?', 'order' => 96],
            ['start_time' => 364.0, 'end_time' => 366.7, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not how we have today.', 'source_text' => 'Ia tidak sebersih bekalan air yang kita nikmati hari ini.', 'order' => 97],
            ['start_time' => 366.8, 'end_time' => 368.66, 'target_text' => 'And he was serving that water to a dog.', 'source_text' => 'Dan lelaki itu memberi minum air tersebut kepada seekor anjing.', 'order' => 98],
            ['start_time' => 368.76, 'end_time' => 369.22, 'target_text' => 'What\'s a dog?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah itu anjing?', 'order' => 99],
            ['start_time' => 369.32, 'end_time' => 370.46, 'target_text' => 'A dog is not a human.', 'source_text' => 'Seekor anjing bukanlah seorang manusia.', 'order' => 100],
            ['start_time' => 370.56, 'end_time' => 375.9, 'target_text' => 'A dog is nothing to do with the the the the the status of a human being in the eyes of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Seekor anjing langsung tiada kaitan dengan darjat kemuliaan seorang manusia di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 101],
            ['start_time' => 376.0, 'end_time' => 377.74, 'target_text' => 'But a dog is just a creature of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi anjing itu adalah makhluk ciptaan Allah jua.', 'order' => 102],
            ['start_time' => 377.84, 'end_time' => 384.42, 'target_text' => 'Perhaps there is such connection between us and a dog that there are a few more rules regarding interaction with a dog in', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin ada pertalian tertentu antara kita dengan anjing sehinggakan terdapat beberapa peraturan khusus mengenai interaksi dengan anjing di dalam', 'order' => 103],
            ['start_time' => 384.52, 'end_time' => 385.42, 'target_text' => 'Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Islam.', 'order' => 104],
            ['start_time' => 385.52, 'end_time' => 391.26, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a very tricky topic because people say, are you or are you not allowed to interact with dogs as Muslims?', 'source_text' => 'Ini topik yang agak sensitif kerana orang sering bertanya, adakah anda dibenarkan atau tidak berinteraksi dengan anjing sebagai orang Islam?', 'order' => 105],
            ['start_time' => 391.36, 'end_time' => 394.14, 'target_text' => 'Definitely you are, but there are a few rules you need to know.', 'source_text' => 'Sudah tentu anda dibenarkan, tetapi terdapat beberapa garis panduan yang wajib anda ketahui.', 'order' => 106],
            ['start_time' => 394.24, 'end_time' => 395.34, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah hakikatnya.', 'order' => 107],
            ['start_time' => 395.44, 'end_time' => 396.86, 'target_text' => 'So, it\'s not like we hate dogs.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, ia bukanlah bermakna kita membenci anjing.', 'order' => 108],
            ['start_time' => 396.96, 'end_time' => 397.78, 'target_text' => 'No, we don\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 109],
            ['start_time' => 397.88, 'end_time' => 403.14, 'target_text' => 'To the degree that even if you were to see pigs, it\'s haram to be bad and cruel to a pig.', 'source_text' => 'Sehinggakan sekiranya anda melihat babi sekalipun, adalah haram untuk kita bersikap zalim dan kejam terhadap babi.', 'order' => 110],
            ['start_time' => 403.24, 'end_time' => 405.06, 'target_text' => 'You\'re not allowed to consume it, correct?', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak dibenarkan memakannya, betul bukan?', 'order' => 111],
            ['start_time' => 405.16, 'end_time' => 406.18, 'target_text' => 'But you have to be kind.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda tetap wajib berbuat ihsan.', 'order' => 112],
            ['start_time' => 406.28, 'end_time' => 406.819, 'target_text' => 'That\'s an animal.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah seekor haiwan.', 'order' => 113],
            ['start_time' => 406.919, 'end_time' => 412.74, 'target_text' => 'If you gave water to a pig, I\'m sure you would be rewarded by Allah in a way that is unimaginable.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda memberi minum kepada seekor babi, saya yakin anda tetap akan diganjari pahala oleh Allah dengan cara yang tidak terbayangkan.', 'order' => 114],
            ['start_time' => 412.84, 'end_time' => 414.74, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us ease.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mempermudah urusan kita.', 'order' => 115],
            ['start_time' => 414.84, 'end_time' => 416.46, 'target_text' => 'But', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi,', 'order' => 116],
            ['start_time' => 416.56, 'end_time' => 422.34, 'target_text' => 'which has a higher status in the eyes of Allah, a human or a dog?', 'source_text' => 'manakah yang mempunyai darjat lebih tinggi di sisi Allah, seorang manusia atau seekor anjing?', 'order' => 117],
            ['start_time' => 422.44, 'end_time' => 424.32, 'target_text' => 'A human.', 'source_text' => 'Seorang manusia.', 'order' => 118],
            ['start_time' => 425.24, 'end_time' => 428.54, 'target_text' => 'The most noble of the creatures of Allah is humankind.', 'source_text' => 'Makhluk ciptaan Allah yang paling mulia adalah umat manusia.', 'order' => 119],
            ['start_time' => 428.64, 'end_time' => 435.819, 'target_text' => 'And so, imagine if you are quenching the thirst of a human being, will you get more or less of a reward?', 'source_text' => 'Maka, bayangkan sekiranya anda menghilangkan dahaga seorang manusia, adakah anda akan mendapat pahala yang lebih besar atau lebih sedikit?', 'order' => 120],
            ['start_time' => 435.919, 'end_time' => 437.38, 'target_text' => 'You\'re going to get more.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pasti akan memperolehi pahala yang jauh lebih besar.', 'order' => 121],
            ['start_time' => 437.48, 'end_time' => 440.5, 'target_text' => 'It depends on your intention, obviously.', 'source_text' => 'Ia sudah tentu bergantung kepada keikhlasan niat anda.', 'order' => 122],
            ['start_time' => 440.6, 'end_time' => 443.06, 'target_text' => 'But you quenching Zamzam.', 'source_text' => 'Lebih-lebih lagi jika anda memberi minum air Zamzam.', 'order' => 123],
            ['start_time' => 443.16, 'end_time' => 446.86, 'target_text' => 'Zamzam is the purest water ever you can have on earth.', 'source_text' => 'Zamzam adalah air yang paling suci dan murni yang pernah ada di muka bumi ini.', 'order' => 124],
            ['start_time' => 446.96, 'end_time' => 449.5, 'target_text' => 'We\'re not going to get purer than Zamzam, right?', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak akan menemui air yang lebih murni daripada Zamzam, bukan?', 'order' => 125],
            ['start_time' => 449.6, 'end_time' => 451.22, 'target_text' => 'Zamzam', 'source_text' => 'Air Zamzam,', 'order' => 126],
            ['start_time' => 451.32, 'end_time' => 457.819, 'target_text' => 'hadith says Zamzam is so pure that it will have an effect for whatever reason and intention it is drunk for.', 'source_text' => 'hadis menyebut bahawa air Zamzam itu begitu suci sehingga ia memberi kesan mujarab mengikut apa jua tujuan dan niat ia diminum.', 'order' => 127],
            ['start_time' => 457.919, 'end_time' => 459.74, 'target_text' => 'We drink it with a certain niya.', 'source_text' => 'Kita meminumnya dengan niat yang tertentu.', 'order' => 128],
            ['start_time' => 459.84, 'end_time' => 461.62, 'target_text' => 'Inshallah, Allah will give you that.', 'source_text' => 'Insya-Allah, Allah pasti akan mengurniakan apa yang anda hajatkan itu.', 'order' => 129],
            ['start_time' => 461.72, 'end_time' => 462.86, 'target_text' => 'Especially shifa.', 'source_text' => 'Khususnya untuk syifa\'.', 'order' => 130],
            ['start_time' => 462.96, 'end_time' => 464.1, 'target_text' => 'It has in it cure.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalamnya terdapat penawar penyakit.', 'order' => 131],
            ['start_time' => 464.2, 'end_time' => 466.78, 'target_text' => 'We drink Zamzam, masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita meminum air Zamzam, masya-Allah.', 'order' => 132],
            ['start_time' => 466.88, 'end_time' => 471.18, 'target_text' => 'And a lot of us have Zamzam at home, even if it\'s a few drops, masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ramai di kalangan kita mempunyai simpanan air Zamzam di rumah, walaupun sekadar beberapa titis, masya-Allah.', 'order' => 133],
            ['start_time' => 471.28, 'end_time' => 472.9, 'target_text' => 'Even if it is a little.', 'source_text' => 'Walaupun hanya sedikit.', 'order' => 134],
            ['start_time' => 473.0, 'end_time' => 480.42, 'target_text' => 'But sometimes, my brothers and sisters, we tend to forget that our duty is to be good to each other and to be kind.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi kadangkala, saudara-saudariku, kita cenderung terlupa bahawa kewajipan kita adalah berbuat baik sesama kita dan saling berlemah lembut.', 'order' => 135],
            ['start_time' => 480.52, 'end_time' => 482.22, 'target_text' => 'And we need to reach out to each other.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita perlu saling menghulurkan tangan bantuan antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 136],
            ['start_time' => 482.32, 'end_time' => 490.38, 'target_text' => 'And we need to make sure that we understand the Hadith of the dog in a far greater way to say, "If that guy was kind to a', 'source_text' => 'Serta kita perlu memastikan bahawa kita memahami hadis tentang anjing tersebut dalam skop yang jauh lebih mendalam, iaitu:', 'order' => 137],
            ['start_time' => 490.48, 'end_time' => 498.06, 'target_text' => 'dog by giving it water that we would not really drink today, imagine what would be the reward for you and I reaching out with', 'source_text' => '"Sekiranya lelaki itu berbuat ihsan kepada anjing dengan memberinya air yang kita sendiri tidak sanggup meminumnya pada hari ini, bayangkan betapa besarnya ganjaran untuk anda dan saya', 'order' => 138],
            ['start_time' => 498.16, 'end_time' => 505.66, 'target_text' => 'proper drinking water in a bottle to another human, more than a human avid, a person who worships Allah, if that were the', 'source_text' => 'menghulurkan air minuman botol yang bersih kepada sesama manusia, apatah lagi kepada seorang hamba yang beriman dan menyembah Allah!"', 'order' => 139],
            ['start_time' => 505.76, 'end_time' => 508.1, 'target_text' => 'case." So, go easy on each other.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, bersikap santun dan saling bertolak ansurlah sesama kamu.', 'order' => 140],
            ['start_time' => 508.2, 'end_time' => 516.939, 'target_text' => 'You never know which of your which of your deeds will be the deed that will tip the scale, inshallah, granting you and I Jannatul', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak pernah tahu amalan yang mana satu di antara amalan anda yang bakal memberatkan timbangan mizan, insya-Allah, melayakkan anda dan saya memasuki Jannatul', 'order' => 141],
            ['start_time' => 517.039, 'end_time' => 518.18, 'target_text' => 'Firdaus.', 'source_text' => 'Firdaus.', 'order' => 142],
            ['start_time' => 518.28, 'end_time' => 519.3, 'target_text' => 'But now, we have an issue.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi kini, timbul satu persoalan.', 'order' => 143],
            ['start_time' => 519.4, 'end_time' => 520.3, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the problem?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah masalahnya?', 'order' => 144],
            ['start_time' => 520.4, 'end_time' => 521.619, 'target_text' => 'I\'m so busy at work.', 'source_text' => 'Saya amat sibuk di tempat kerja.', 'order' => 145],
            ['start_time' => 521.719, 'end_time' => 523.819, 'target_text' => 'I interact with the opposite sex.', 'source_text' => 'Saya perlu berinteraksi dengan jantina yang berlainan.', 'order' => 146],
            ['start_time' => 523.919, 'end_time' => 527.22, 'target_text' => 'Is it haram to interact with the opposite sex?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah haram berinteraksi dengan jantina yang berlainan?', 'order' => 147],
            ['start_time' => 527.32, 'end_time' => 528.34, 'target_text' => 'Is it haram?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah ia haram?', 'order' => 148],
            ['start_time' => 528.44, 'end_time' => 530.02, 'target_text' => 'No, not at all.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, langsung tidak haram.', 'order' => 149],
            ['start_time' => 530.12, 'end_time' => 536.3, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m allowed to interact with a dog with certain rules, I definitely am definitely allowed to interact with the opposite', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya dibenarkan berinteraksi dengan seekor anjing dengan peraturan tertentu, sudah pasti saya dibenarkan berinteraksi dengan jantina', 'order' => 150],
            ['start_time' => 536.4, 'end_time' => 539.98, 'target_text' => 'sex with a few rules, a few things you need to bear in mind.', 'source_text' => 'berlainan dengan beberapa batasan syariat yang perlu sentiasa anda semat dalam ingatan.', 'order' => 151],
            ['start_time' => 540.08, 'end_time' => 542.38, 'target_text' => 'You know, you you need not to cross certain lines.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu menjaga batas agar tidak melangkaui sempadan tertentu.', 'order' => 152],
            ['start_time' => 542.48, 'end_time' => 543.26, 'target_text' => 'That\'s there.', 'source_text' => 'Itu ketetapan yang jelas.', 'order' => 153],
            ['start_time' => 543.36, 'end_time' => 547.739, 'target_text' => 'So, people say, "Sheikh, why did you talk to this woman?" Why not?', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, orang bertanya, "Syeikh, mengapa anda bercakap dengan wanita ini?" Mengapa tidak?', 'order' => 154],
            ['start_time' => 547.839, 'end_time' => 548.78, 'target_text' => 'What did I do?', 'source_text' => 'Apa kesalahan yang saya lakukan?', 'order' => 155],
            ['start_time' => 548.88, 'end_time' => 549.9, 'target_text' => 'There was no halwa.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada unsur khalwat.', 'order' => 156],
            ['start_time' => 550.0, 'end_time' => 550.98, 'target_text' => 'There was respect.', 'source_text' => 'Penuh dengan rasa hormat.', 'order' => 157],
            ['start_time' => 551.08, 'end_time' => 553.62, 'target_text' => 'We treated her with goodness and dignity.', 'source_text' => 'Kami melayannya dengan kebaikan, santun dan bermaruah.', 'order' => 158],
            ['start_time' => 553.72, 'end_time' => 555.739, 'target_text' => 'We tried to do whatever we had to.', 'source_text' => 'Kami menunaikan apa yang perlu dilaksanakan.', 'order' => 159],
            ['start_time' => 555.839, 'end_time' => 556.739, 'target_text' => 'We lowered our gaze.', 'source_text' => 'Kami menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 556.839, 'end_time' => 557.82, 'target_text' => 'We Whatever we had to do.', 'source_text' => 'Kami mematuhi apa jua yang wajib dipatuhi.', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 557.92, 'end_time' => 559.38, 'target_text' => 'All those rules in place.', 'source_text' => 'Semua peraturan tersebut sentiasa dipelihara.', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 559.48, 'end_time' => 561.14, 'target_text' => 'But we interacted.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi urusan interaksi tetap berlaku.', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 561.24, 'end_time' => 562.58, 'target_text' => 'You go into a pharmacy.', 'source_text' => 'Anda melangkah masuk ke farmasi.', 'order' => 164],
            ['start_time' => 562.68, 'end_time' => 564.3, 'target_text' => 'You need to seek medication.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu mendapatkan ubat-ubatan.', 'order' => 165],
            ['start_time' => 564.4, 'end_time' => 566.66, 'target_text' => 'And there is a young lady there.', 'source_text' => 'Dan terdapat seorang wanita muda yang bertugas di situ.', 'order' => 166],
            ['start_time' => 566.76, 'end_time' => 568.14, 'target_text' => 'And she is looking at you.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dia memandang ke arah anda sambil menyapa,', 'order' => 167],
            ['start_time' => 568.24, 'end_time' => 568.86, 'target_text' => '"Morning, sir.', 'source_text' => '"Selamat pagi, tuan.', 'order' => 168],
            ['start_time' => 568.96, 'end_time' => 575.26, 'target_text' => 'How are you, sir?" Are you going to say la ilaha illallah astaghfirullahal azim wala hawla wala quwwata illa billahi aliyyil', 'source_text' => 'Apa khabar, tuan?" Adakah anda terus membalas dengan la ilaha illallah astaghfirullahal azim wala hawla wala quwwata illa billahi aliyyil', 'order' => 169],
            ['start_time' => 575.36, 'end_time' => 575.82, 'target_text' => 'azim?', 'source_text' => 'azim?', 'order' => 170],
            ['start_time' => 575.92, 'end_time' => 576.34, 'target_text' => 'Correct.', 'source_text' => 'Benar.', 'order' => 171],
            ['start_time' => 576.44, 'end_time' => 582.94, 'target_text' => 'In your heart and mind, you are conscious of Allah, so you say my sister, I\'m looking for paracetamol.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam hati dan sanubari anda, anda sentiasa mengingati Allah, lalu anda membalas, "Saudariku, saya sedang mencari parasetamol."', 'order' => 172],
            ['start_time' => 583.04, 'end_time' => 584.82, 'target_text' => 'This is what I need and so on.', 'source_text' => '"Ini ubat yang saya perlukan" dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 173],
            ['start_time' => 584.92, 'end_time' => 585.86, 'target_text' => 'And what did you do?', 'source_text' => 'Dan apakah yang telah anda lakukan?', 'order' => 174],
            ['start_time' => 585.96, 'end_time' => 589.38, 'target_text' => 'You called her my sister and you interacted with her in a beautiful way.', 'source_text' => 'Anda memanggilnya dengan panggilan \'saudariku\' dan berinteraksi dengannya dengan cara yang amat berhemah.', 'order' => 175],
            ['start_time' => 589.48, 'end_time' => 589.88, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa kesannya?', 'order' => 176],
            ['start_time' => 589.96, 'end_time' => 593.22, 'target_text' => 'She might become interested even in the dean of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dia mungkin akan mula tertarik hati kepada keindahan agama Allah ini.', 'order' => 177],
            ['start_time' => 593.32, 'end_time' => 594.58, 'target_text' => 'Correct or not?', 'source_text' => 'Betul atau tidak?', 'order' => 178],
            ['start_time' => 594.68, 'end_time' => 598.5, 'target_text' => 'She would say these people are very, very respectful, polite.', 'source_text' => 'Dia pasti akan berkata bahawa orang Islam ini sangat menghormati orang lain dan amat bersopan santun.', 'order' => 179],
            ['start_time' => 598.6, 'end_time' => 599.86, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what Islam is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah intipati ajaran Islam yang sebenar.', 'order' => 180],
            ['start_time' => 599.96, 'end_time' => 604.06, 'target_text' => 'Respect, politeness, goodness while worshipping Allah alone.', 'source_text' => 'Hormat-menghormati, kesopanan dan berbuat ihsan di samping mengesakan dan menyembah Allah semata-mata.', 'order' => 181],
            ['start_time' => 604.16, 'end_time' => 608.58, 'target_text' => 'What you need to worry about is to make sure Allah is pleased.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara utama yang perlu anda risaukan adalah memastikan Allah reda kepada anda.', 'order' => 182],
            ['start_time' => 608.68, 'end_time' => 611.26, 'target_text' => 'If Allah is pleased, what more do you want?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya Allah sudah reda, apa lagi yang anda inginkan?', 'order' => 183],
            ['start_time' => 611.36, 'end_time' => 612.7, 'target_text' => 'I did something good.', 'source_text' => 'Saya telah melakukan sesuatu kebaikan.', 'order' => 184],
            ['start_time' => 612.8, 'end_time' => 616.26, 'target_text' => 'Now, in my interactions, I might have slipped up a little bit, right?', 'source_text' => 'Namun, dalam pergaulan harian saya, mungkin saya ada sedikit terkhilaf, bukan?', 'order' => 185],
            ['start_time' => 616.36, 'end_time' => 618.3, 'target_text' => 'Went to work, slipped up a little bit.', 'source_text' => 'Keluar bekerja, tergelincir sedikit kesilapan.', 'order' => 186],
            ['start_time' => 618.4, 'end_time' => 621.18, 'target_text' => 'I might have been distracted a little bit.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin fikiran saya ada sedikit terleka.', 'order' => 187],
            ['start_time' => 621.28, 'end_time' => 629.46, 'target_text' => 'The other day, we went into a restaurant and mashallah alhamdulillah la ilaha illallah, the owners were Muslims.', 'source_text' => 'Baru-baru ini, kami berkunjung ke sebuah restoran, dan masya-Allah alhamdulillah la ilaha illallah, pemiliknya adalah orang Islam.', 'order' => 188],
            ['start_time' => 629.56, 'end_time' => 630.42, 'target_text' => 'Right?', 'source_text' => 'Betul bukan?', 'order' => 189],
            ['start_time' => 630.52, 'end_time' => 633.06, 'target_text' => 'And they there was some music in the background.', 'source_text' => 'Dan pada waktu itu, ada alunan muzik dipasang di ruang latar belakang.', 'order' => 190],
            ['start_time' => 633.16, 'end_time' => 633.94, 'target_text' => 'We didn\'t say anything.', 'source_text' => 'Kami tidak menegur atau berkata apa-apa.', 'order' => 191],
            ['start_time' => 634.04, 'end_time' => 636.1, 'target_text' => 'We just went in and said As-salamu alaykum.', 'source_text' => 'Kami hanya melangkah masuk dan mengucapkan, "As-salamu alaykum."', 'order' => 192],
            ['start_time' => 636.2, 'end_time' => 637.7, 'target_text' => 'We had a seat.', 'source_text' => 'Kami pun mengambil tempat duduk.', 'order' => 193],
            ['start_time' => 637.8, 'end_time' => 641.1, 'target_text' => 'In a short time, there was no more music in the background.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam masa yang singkat, muzik di latar belakang tadi terus dipadamkan.', 'order' => 194],
            ['start_time' => 641.2, 'end_time' => 642.66, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apa yang telah berlaku?', 'order' => 195],
            ['start_time' => 642.76, 'end_time' => 643.46, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah puncanya?', 'order' => 196],
            ['start_time' => 643.56, 'end_time' => 649.38, 'target_text' => 'Just out of respect, I think, they must have decided, you know, these bearded fellows walked in, let\'s just turn off this', 'source_text' => 'Semata-mata kerana rasa hormat, saya fikir, mereka tentu berkata, "Orang-orang berkopiah dan berjanggut ini baru masuk, mari kita matikan muzik', 'order' => 197],
            ['start_time' => 649.48, 'end_time' => 651.06, 'target_text' => 'thing here, perhaps.', 'source_text' => 'ini seketika."', 'order' => 198],
            ['start_time' => 651.16, 'end_time' => 654.7, 'target_text' => 'I would have thought perhaps maybe in a little while some Quran will start playing.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pada mulanya menyangka mungkin selepas itu mereka akan memasang alunan bacaan ayat suci al-Quran.', 'order' => 199],
            ['start_time' => 654.8, 'end_time' => 656.02, 'target_text' => 'But that didn\'t happen.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi itu tidak berlaku.', 'order' => 200],
            ['start_time' => 656.12, 'end_time' => 656.58, 'target_text' => 'The food came.', 'source_text' => 'Makanan pun tiba.', 'order' => 201],
            ['start_time' => 656.68, 'end_time' => 657.42, 'target_text' => 'It was good enough.', 'source_text' => 'Rasanya cukup enak dan memuaskan.', 'order' => 202],
            ['start_time' => 657.52, 'end_time' => 658.86, 'target_text' => 'I didn\'t ask anything.', 'source_text' => 'Saya langsung tidak meminta apa-apa perubahan.', 'order' => 203],
            ['start_time' => 658.96, 'end_time' => 661.18, 'target_text' => 'No one requested anything to be shut off.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sesiapa pun meminta agar apa-apa ditutup.', 'order' => 204],
            ['start_time' => 661.28, 'end_time' => 664.86, 'target_text' => 'A lot of the times with us, we don\'t even notice the music in the background.', 'source_text' => 'Kebanyakan masa dalam kehidupan kita, kita sendiri tidak perasan bunyi muzik di latar belakang.', 'order' => 205],
            ['start_time' => 664.96, 'end_time' => 668.82, 'target_text' => 'Until someone says, "Can you hear what\'s happening?" I said, "Brother, why did you say that?', 'source_text' => 'Sehinggalah seseorang menegur, "Adakah anda dengar apa yang sedang dipasang itu?" Saya berkata, "Wahai saudaraku, mengapa anda berkata begitu?', 'order' => 206],
            ['start_time' => 668.92, 'end_time' => 673.5, 'target_text' => 'I I didn\'t hear it until you told me." You know, our minds are occupied with something.', 'source_text' => 'Saya langsung tidak mendengarnya sehinggalah anda memberitahu saya." Anda tahu, fikiran kita sering sarat dengan perkara lain.', 'order' => 207],
            ['start_time' => 673.6, 'end_time' => 675.22, 'target_text' => 'Many times we don\'t hear things.', 'source_text' => 'Banyak kali kita sebenarnya tidak mendengar bunyi sekeliling.', 'order' => 208],
            ['start_time' => 675.32, 'end_time' => 681.06, 'target_text' => 'And then when you draw our attention to it, then we notice, "Oh, oh, why did you tell me?" Like this.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila anda menarik perhatian kami kepadanya, barulah kami tersedar, "Aduh, mengapa pula anda beritahu saya?" Begitulah keadaannya.', 'order' => 209],
            ['start_time' => 681.16, 'end_time' => 686.38, 'target_text' => 'But in all of that, some people sometimes because of the pressure', 'source_text' => 'Namun dalam semua situasi itu, ada sesetengah orang kadangkala disebabkan oleh tekanan', 'order' => 210],
            ['start_time' => 686.48, 'end_time' => 694.86, 'target_text' => 'of peers or society or community or a few people around, they end up doing bad things such as falling into drugs, falling', 'source_text' => 'rakan sebaya, masyarakat, komuniti, atau segelintir orang di sekeliling mereka, akhirnya terjerumus melakukan perkara buruk seperti dadah, terjebak', 'order' => 211],
            ['start_time' => 694.96, 'end_time' => 700.56, 'target_text' => 'into addictions, getting into bad habits, and the list is quite long.', 'source_text' => 'dengan ketagihan, terbiasa dengan tabiat buruk, dan senarainya amat panjang.', 'order' => 212],
            ['start_time' => 700.76, 'end_time' => 706.46, 'target_text' => 'But Allah Almighty, when he loves us, he taps us and brings us back to him.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa, apabila Dia menyayangi hamba-Nya, Dia akan menyentuh hati kita dan memimpin kita kembali kepada-Nya.', 'order' => 213],
            ['start_time' => 706.56, 'end_time' => 709.22, 'target_text' => 'Today we are seated in this place here.', 'source_text' => 'Hari ini kita sedang duduk di tempat yang mulia ini.', 'order' => 214],
            ['start_time' => 709.32, 'end_time' => 712.1, 'target_text' => 'Is it not known as the house of Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah tempat ini dikenali sebagai rumah Allah?', 'order' => 215],
            ['start_time' => 712.2, 'end_time' => 714.74, 'target_text' => 'You are sitting here, you are more than welcome.', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang duduk di sini, kehadiran anda amat dialu-alukan.', 'order' => 216],
            ['start_time' => 714.84, 'end_time' => 716.42, 'target_text' => 'You are a guest of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Anda semua adalah para tetamu Allah.', 'order' => 217],
            ['start_time' => 716.52, 'end_time' => 721.82, 'target_text' => 'We are here, masha Allah, not to chase you away, but to tell you this is the right place.', 'source_text' => 'Kehadiran kami di sini, masya-Allah, bukan untuk menghalau anda, sebaliknya untuk memberitahu anda bahawa inilah tempat yang paling tepat.', 'order' => 218],
            ['start_time' => 721.92, 'end_time' => 723.42, 'target_text' => 'You want to come, come here.', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda ingin ke mana-mana, datanglah ke sini.', 'order' => 219],
            ['start_time' => 723.52, 'end_time' => 729.22, 'target_text' => 'If I could change anything right here and right now, I would only ask everyone to open all the windows, but don\'t worry, it\'s', 'source_text' => 'Jika ada satu perkara yang ingin saya ubah di sini sekarang juga, saya hanya ingin meminta semua orang membuka semua tingkap, tetapi jangan risau,', 'order' => 220],
            ['start_time' => 729.32, 'end_time' => 730.34, 'target_text' => 'not my place.', 'source_text' => 'ini bukan rumah saya.', 'order' => 221],
            ['start_time' => 730.44, 'end_time' => 731.02, 'target_text' => 'It\'s your place.', 'source_text' => 'Ini rumah anda semua.', 'order' => 222],
            ['start_time' => 731.12, 'end_time' => 733.66, 'target_text' => 'It\'s up to you to decide what you want to do.', 'source_text' => 'Terpulang kepada anda untuk menentukan apa yang ingin anda lakukan.', 'order' => 223],
            ['start_time' => 733.76, 'end_time' => 740.4, 'target_text' => 'But Allah Almighty grant us is How did you like my way of saying, "Guys, it\'s a bit hot in here?" Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kemudahan. Bagaimana anda menilai cara halus saya menyampaikan bahawa, "Tuan-tuan, di dalam ini agak panas?" Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 224],
            ['start_time' => 741.4, 'end_time' => 743.42, 'target_text' => 'Brother, you walked in Zimbabwe.', 'source_text' => '"Wahai saudaraku, anda pernah berkunjung ke Zimbabwe?"', 'order' => 225],
            ['start_time' => 743.52, 'end_time' => 746.58, 'target_text' => 'Yes, Zimbabwe is much cooler than this, my beloved brother.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, Zimbabwe jauh lebih sejuk daripada ini, wahai saudaraku yang dikasihi.', 'order' => 226],
            ['start_time' => 746.68, 'end_time' => 747.78, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Bukan begitu.', 'order' => 227],
            ['start_time' => 747.88, 'end_time' => 751.98, 'target_text' => 'Uh the inside of the buildings, masha Allah, they are much, much cooler.', 'source_text' => 'Bahagian dalam bangunan di sana, masya-Allah, suasananya jauh lebih sejuk dan nyaman.', 'order' => 228],
            ['start_time' => 752.08, 'end_time' => 753.58, 'target_text' => 'Allahumma barik.', 'source_text' => 'Allahumma barik.', 'order' => 229],
            ['start_time' => 753.68, 'end_time' => 759.66, 'target_text' => 'But the outside is a bit Here it\'s cooler outside, but what\'s the point of it being so cool outside at this time of the night', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi di luar agak hangat. Di sini suasananya sejuk di luar, tetapi apa gunanya di luar begitu sejuk pada waktu malam sebegini', 'order' => 230],
            ['start_time' => 759.76, 'end_time' => 760.98, 'target_text' => 'when inside we are sweating?', 'source_text' => 'sedangkan di dalam ini kita semua bermandi peluh?', 'order' => 231],
            ['start_time' => 761.08, 'end_time' => 762.14, 'target_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 232],
            ['start_time' => 762.24, 'end_time' => 764.46, 'target_text' => 'Because of such the numbers, and you know why we\'re sweating?', 'source_text' => 'Disebabkan kehadiran jemaah yang begitu ramai, dan tahukah anda mengapa kita berpeluh?', 'order' => 233],
            ['start_time' => 764.56, 'end_time' => 766.9, 'target_text' => 'Let me tell you why.', 'source_text' => 'Biar saya beritahu anda puncanya.', 'order' => 234],
            ['start_time' => 767.0, 'end_time' => 768.86, 'target_text' => 'The warmth of our hearts.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana kehangatan kasih sayang yang terpancar dari hati sanubari kita.', 'order' => 235],
            ['start_time' => 768.96, 'end_time' => 770.38, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 236],
            ['start_time' => 770.48, 'end_time' => 774.3, 'target_text' => 'Warmth of the hearts, lovely people, beaming faces.', 'source_text' => 'Kehangatan hati, keperibadian insan-insan yang baik, wajah-wajah yang berseri-seri.', 'order' => 237],
            ['start_time' => 774.4, 'end_time' => 776.26, 'target_text' => 'Did that make a difference, guys?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah tingkap yang dibuka tadi memberi perbezaan yang menyegarkan?', 'order' => 238],
            ['start_time' => 776.36, 'end_time' => 779.42, 'target_text' => 'Air conditioning min indillah bis sama.', 'source_text' => 'Penyaman udara terus min \'indillah dari langit.', 'order' => 239],
            ['start_time' => 779.52, 'end_time' => 780.02, 'target_text' => 'Huh?', 'source_text' => 'Kan?', 'order' => 240],
            ['start_time' => 780.12, 'end_time' => 781.82, 'target_text' => 'Beautiful, masha Allah tabarak Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Sungguh indah, masya-Allah tabarakallah.', 'order' => 241],
            ['start_time' => 781.92, 'end_time' => 784.1, 'target_text' => 'Now, why did I say what I said?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa saya berkata seperti yang saya katakan tadi?', 'order' => 242],
            ['start_time' => 784.2, 'end_time' => 785.14, 'target_text' => 'Do you know?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda sebabnya?', 'order' => 243],
            ['start_time' => 785.24, 'end_time' => 786.5, 'target_text' => 'Because I\'m your brother.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana saya adalah saudara anda.', 'order' => 244],
            ['start_time' => 786.6, 'end_time' => 788.02, 'target_text' => 'In some cases, your younger brother.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi sesetengah daripada anda, saya adalah adik anda.', 'order' => 245],
            ['start_time' => 788.12, 'end_time' => 789.739, 'target_text' => 'In some cases, your older brother.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi sesetengah yang lain, saya adalah abang anda.', 'order' => 246],
            ['start_time' => 789.839, 'end_time' => 796.02, 'target_text' => 'If I didn\'t open my mouth, I would finish the whole talk regretting that why didn\'t you say open the windows?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya tidak bersuara, saya pasti akan menamatkan seluruh ceramah ini dengan rasa kesal mengapa saya tidak meminta agar tingkap dibuka.', 'order' => 247],
            ['start_time' => 796.12, 'end_time' => 798.66, 'target_text' => 'So, I had to say it in a very diplomatic way.', 'source_text' => 'Maka saya terpaksa menyampaikannya secara sangat berhemah dan diplomatik.', 'order' => 248],
            ['start_time' => 798.76, 'end_time' => 800.84, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 249],
            ['start_time' => 801.44, 'end_time' => 802.62, 'target_text' => 'Very technical.', 'source_text' => 'Sangat teknikal pendekatannya.', 'order' => 250],
            ['start_time' => 802.72, 'end_time' => 804.26, 'target_text' => 'But did it not open the windows?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi bukankah tingkap akhirnya berjaya dibuka?', 'order' => 251],
            ['start_time' => 804.36, 'end_time' => 804.76, 'target_text' => 'Yes.', 'source_text' => 'Ya.', 'order' => 252],
            ['start_time' => 804.839, 'end_time' => 806.54, 'target_text' => 'Alhamdulillah, so it worked.', 'source_text' => 'Alhamdulillah, ia ternyata membuahkan hasil.', 'order' => 253],
            ['start_time' => 806.64, 'end_time' => 812.82, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why I say sometimes when we are telling you something, you might not realize how we are saying it, but we get to the', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah saya katakan, kadangkala apabila kami menasihati anda tentang sesuatu, anda mungkin tidak menyedari gaya bahasa kami menyampaikannya, tetapi kita tetap mencapai', 'order' => 254],
            ['start_time' => 812.92, 'end_time' => 814.46, 'target_text' => 'same end result.', 'source_text' => 'hasil matlamat akhir yang sama.', 'order' => 255],
            ['start_time' => 814.56, 'end_time' => 815.54, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what\'s important.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah perkara yang paling penting.', 'order' => 256],
            ['start_time' => 815.64, 'end_time' => 816.86, 'target_text' => 'End result is what is important.', 'source_text' => 'Matlamat akhirlah yang menjadi keutamaan.', 'order' => 257],
            ['start_time' => 816.96, 'end_time' => 818.54, 'target_text' => 'How I said it, different.', 'source_text' => 'Cara penyampaian saya mungkin berbeza.', 'order' => 258],
            ['start_time' => 818.64, 'end_time' => 823.98, 'target_text' => 'You will hear from all the scholars and those who want to remind you of Allah to pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'Anda akan mendengar daripada semua alim ulama dan para pendakwah yang mengingatkan anda tentang Allah agar menunaikan solat lima waktu sehari semalam.', 'order' => 259],
            ['start_time' => 824.08, 'end_time' => 827.7, 'target_text' => 'But each one will use a different method to tell you exactly the same thing.', 'source_text' => 'Namun setiap daripada mereka akan menggunakan pendekatan berbeza untuk menyampaikan mesej yang sama.', 'order' => 260],
            ['start_time' => 827.8, 'end_time' => 829.94, 'target_text' => 'The idea is to get to the end result.', 'source_text' => 'Tujuannya adalah untuk mencapai hasil akhir yang diinginkan.', 'order' => 261],
            ['start_time' => 830.04, 'end_time' => 832.58, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what is the ultimate end result for a moment?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apakah matlamat akhir yang paling agung bagi setiap saat kehidupan kita?', 'order' => 262],
            ['start_time' => 832.68, 'end_time' => 833.66, 'target_text' => 'Say it.', 'source_text' => 'Sebutlah ia bersama-sama.', 'order' => 263],
            ['start_time' => 833.76, 'end_time' => 835.06, 'target_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus.', 'source_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus.', 'order' => 264],
            ['start_time' => 835.16, 'end_time' => 838.54, 'target_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus, one of the only places better than Aberdeen.', 'source_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus, antara satu-satunya tempat yang jauh lebih indah daripada Aberdeen.', 'order' => 265],
            ['start_time' => 838.64, 'end_time' => 839.78, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 266],
            ['start_time' => 839.88, 'end_time' => 841.42, 'target_text' => 'May Allah protect you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memelihara anda semua.', 'order' => 267],
            ['start_time' => 841.52, 'end_time' => 844.46, 'target_text' => 'I see the guys are smiling because they\'re disagreeing with me, right?', 'source_text' => 'Saya melihat para jemaah tersenyum kerana tidak bersetuju dengan perbandingan saya tadi, betul bukan?', 'order' => 268],
            ['start_time' => 844.56, 'end_time' => 849.54, 'target_text' => 'There are a lot of other more beautiful places, but inshallah, for me, it\'s something big because it\'s not like I come to', 'source_text' => 'Pasti ada banyak lagi tempat lain yang lebih indah, namun insya-Allah, bagi saya ia suatu perkara yang amat bermakna kerana bukanlah selalu saya berpeluang datang ke', 'order' => 269],
            ['start_time' => 849.64, 'end_time' => 850.9, 'target_text' => 'Aberdeen all the time.', 'source_text' => 'Aberdeen.', 'order' => 270],
            ['start_time' => 851.0, 'end_time' => 851.7, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 271],
            ['start_time' => 851.8, 'end_time' => 859.7, 'target_text' => 'But nonetheless, I was saying sometimes we develop bad habits and we get into something that we are not happy with as time', 'source_text' => 'Namun apa pun, seperti yang saya katakan tadi, kadangkala kita terbiasa dengan tabiat buruk dan terjerumus ke dalam perkara yang lama-kelamaan membuatkan kita berasa tidak', 'order' => 272],
            ['start_time' => 859.8, 'end_time' => 860.74, 'target_text' => 'passes.', 'source_text' => 'tenang.', 'order' => 273],
            ['start_time' => 860.84, 'end_time' => 869.66, 'target_text' => 'At some point, because of our friends who may be involved in addictions and various other distractions, we feel happy.', 'source_text' => 'Pada mulanya, disebabkan pengaruh rakan-rakan yang mungkin terlibat dengan ketagihan dan pelbagai perkara yang melalaikan, kita berasa seronok.', 'order' => 274],
            ['start_time' => 869.76, 'end_time' => 878.5, 'target_text' => 'And we don\'t realize that Allah Almighty, out of his father and his mercy, he will bring us to his house because we have a', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita tidak sedar bahawa Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa, dengan limpah kurnia dan rahmat-Nya, akan memimpin kita kembali ke rumah-Nya kerana masih ada', 'order' => 275],
            ['start_time' => 878.6, 'end_time' => 882.48, 'target_text' => 'flicker of Iman in our hearts.', 'source_text' => 'sekelumit sinar iman di dalam hati kita.', 'order' => 276],
            ['start_time' => 883.52, 'end_time' => 888.94, 'target_text' => 'Do you know there is a Hadith where the Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam says there will come a time when Can you move aside', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda terdapat hadis di mana Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam bersabda bahawa akan tiba suatu masa di mana — bolehkah anda berganjak ke tepi sedikit', 'order' => 277],
            ['start_time' => 889.04, 'end_time' => 894.22, 'target_text' => 'because every day we deal with the movement of this and everyone complains that the the video is cracking.', 'source_text' => 'kerana setiap hari kami berdepan masalah pergerakan tripod ini dan semua orang mengadu bahawa rakaman video bergegar dan terputus-putus.', 'order' => 278],
            ['start_time' => 894.32, 'end_time' => 896.82, 'target_text' => 'So you have to move a little bit aside.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi anda perlu beralih ke tepi sedikit.', 'order' => 279],
            ['start_time' => 896.92, 'end_time' => 906.9, 'target_text' => 'But my beloved brothers, there is a Hadith that says that Allah Almighty will instruct the angels at the time to say, "Remove', 'source_text' => 'Namun wahai saudara-saudaraku yang dikasihi, terdapat sebuah hadis yang menyatakan bahawa Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa akan memerintahkan para malaikat pada ketika itu dengan berfirman, "Keluarkanlah', 'order' => 280],
            ['start_time' => 907.0, 'end_time' => 917.58, 'target_text' => 'from Jahannam anyone who has even an atom\'s weight worth of Iman." So we have Iman, Allah will bring us to his house by his', 'source_text' => 'dari neraka Jahannam sesiapa sahaja yang memiliki iman walaupun sekecil zarah." Maka selagi kita mempunyai iman, Allah akan membawa kita ke rumah-Nya dengan kehendak-', 'order' => 281],
            ['start_time' => 917.68, 'end_time' => 918.18, 'target_text' => 'will.', 'source_text' => 'Nya.', 'order' => 282],
            ['start_time' => 918.28, 'end_time' => 925.66, 'target_text' => 'And I always say, my brother, when you do something bad, my beloved sister, when you sinned against Allah, if you have a feeling', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya sentiasa berpesan, wahai saudaraku apabila anda melakukan keburukan, wahai saudariku yang dikasihi apabila anda terlanjur berdosa kepada Allah, sekiranya timbul rasa', 'order' => 283],
            ['start_time' => 925.76, 'end_time' => 929.46, 'target_text' => 'in your heart of regret, it\'s a sign that you are a believer.', 'source_text' => 'penyesalan di dalam hati anda, itu adalah petanda bahawa anda seorang yang beriman.', 'order' => 284],
            ['start_time' => 929.56, 'end_time' => 932.66, 'target_text' => 'Because if you were not a believer, why would you regret?', 'source_text' => 'Kerana sekiranya anda bukan seorang yang beriman, mengapa pula anda perlu berasa menyesal?', 'order' => 285],
            ['start_time' => 932.76, 'end_time' => 935.0, 'target_text' => 'What is the regret?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah erti penyesalan itu?', 'order' => 286],
            ['start_time' => 940.0, 'end_time' => 945.66, 'target_text' => 'If If your good deed makes you a little bit happy, you know, when you get up early for salatul Fajr, tahajjud, you did something', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya amalan soleh anda membuatkan anda berasa sedikit gembira — anda tahu, apabila anda bangun awal pagi untuk solat Subuh, bertahajud, anda melakukan suatu', 'order' => 287],
            ['start_time' => 945.76, 'end_time' => 948.38, 'target_text' => 'good, you gave a charity, you went to Mecca for Umrah, etc.', 'source_text' => 'kebaikan, anda bersedekah, anda menunaikan umrah di Makkah dan sebagainya —', 'order' => 288],
            ['start_time' => 948.48, 'end_time' => 956.1, 'target_text' => 'If it that makes you feel happy within and content and fulfilled and your your bad deed makes you regret and sad, that is', 'source_text' => 'sekiranya perkara tersebut mendatangkan rasa bahagia, tenang dan lapang di dalam jiwa anda, dan sebaliknya amalan buruk membuatkan anda berasa kesal dan pilu, itu', 'order' => 289],
            ['start_time' => 956.2, 'end_time' => 958.46, 'target_text' => 'a sign that you are a believer.', 'source_text' => 'adalah bukti nyata bahawa anda seorang yang beriman.', 'order' => 290],
            ['start_time' => 958.56, 'end_time' => 960.3, 'target_text' => 'There is accountability in you.', 'source_text' => 'Masih ada rasa tanggungjawab dan kepekaan hisab di dalam diri anda.', 'order' => 291],
            ['start_time' => 960.4, 'end_time' => 961.74, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why you feel that way.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah puncanya mengapa anda merasai perasaan sedemikian.', 'order' => 292],
            ['start_time' => 961.84, 'end_time' => 968.18, 'target_text' => 'If there was no accountability in you, subhanallah, you would not need to feel good or bad for anything.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya tiada kepekaan hisab dalam diri anda, subhanallah, anda tidak akan berasa gembira mahupun bersalah terhadap apa jua yang anda lakukan.', 'order' => 293],
            ['start_time' => 968.28, 'end_time' => 974.7, 'target_text' => 'So, my beloved brothers and sisters, Allah brings you to his house and you are sitting here with all the people from the same', 'source_text' => 'Maka, wahai saudara-saudariku yang dikasihi, Allah memimpin anda ke rumah-Nya dan anda duduk di sini bersama warga sekota atau', 'order' => 294],
            ['start_time' => 974.8, 'end_time' => 977.54, 'target_text' => 'city or village and mashallah, what are we listening to?', 'source_text' => 'sekampung, dan masya-Allah, apa yang sedang kita dengarkan?', 'order' => 295],
            ['start_time' => 977.64, 'end_time' => 980.9, 'target_text' => 'We\'re listening to someone telling us, "Come, let\'s go to Allah together.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sedang mendengar seruan seseorang yang mengajak kita, "Marilah kita bersama-sama kembali mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 296],
            ['start_time' => 981.0, 'end_time' => 981.54, 'target_text' => 'Come.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah.', 'order' => 297],
            ['start_time' => 981.64, 'end_time' => 989.44, 'target_text' => 'I have weaknesses, you have weaknesses, I have sinned, you have sinned, but surely shouldn\'t we stop that now?', 'source_text' => 'Saya ada kelemahan, anda ada kelemahan, saya pernah berbuat dosa, anda pernah berbuat dosa, tetapi tidakkah wajar untuk kita menghentikannya sekarang?', 'order' => 298],
            ['start_time' => 1002.839, 'end_time' => 1004.34, 'target_text' => 'Is it not time?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah tiba masanya?', 'order' => 299],
            ['start_time' => 1004.44, 'end_time' => 1011.3, 'target_text' => 'Is it not time that the believers, their hearts turn towards Allah and revelation and the truth?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah sampai masanya bagi orang-orang yang beriman agar hati mereka tunduk dan khusyuk mengingati Allah, wahyu-Nya dan kebenaran?', 'order' => 300],
            ['start_time' => 1011.4, 'end_time' => 1012.34, 'target_text' => 'Is it not time?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah tiba masanya?', 'order' => 301],
            ['start_time' => 1012.44, 'end_time' => 1013.62, 'target_text' => 'What are you waiting for?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah lagi yang anda tunggu?', 'order' => 302],
            ['start_time' => 1013.72, 'end_time' => 1016.9, 'target_text' => 'How long do you want before you come back to Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa lama lagi masa yang anda perlukan sebelum kembali kepada Allah?', 'order' => 303],
            ['start_time' => 1017.0, 'end_time' => 1024.099, 'target_text' => 'Come slowly but surely if need be, but make sure the movement is in the right direction, not in the wrong direction.', 'source_text' => 'Kembalilah secara perlahan-lahan tetapi pasti sekiranya perlu, namun pastikan langkah anda menuju ke arah yang benar, bukan ke arah yang salah.', 'order' => 304],
            ['start_time' => 1024.199, 'end_time' => 1026.62, 'target_text' => 'You are struggling with your prayer, guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang bergelut untuk menjaga solat anda, tahukah anda?', 'order' => 305],
            ['start_time' => 1026.72, 'end_time' => 1028.94, 'target_text' => 'We all have our struggles.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua mempunyai ujian dan perjuangan masing-masing.', 'order' => 306],
            ['start_time' => 1029.04, 'end_time' => 1035.999, 'target_text' => 'But the weakness would be from four you go to three and from three you go to two, that is a loss.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kelemahan yang nyata adalah apabila daripada empat waktu solat anda merosot ke tiga, dan daripada tiga berkurang menjadi dua — itu suatu kerugian yang nyata.', 'order' => 307],
            ['start_time' => 1036.16, 'end_time' => 1043.26, 'target_text' => 'Successful is a person whom from two when he\'s struggling but he goes to three because of dedication and the love of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Orang yang berjaya adalah seseorang yang walaupun bergelut daripada dua waktu, dia berusaha meningkat ke tiga waktu kerana keazaman dan rasa cintanya kepada Allah.', 'order' => 308],
            ['start_time' => 1043.36, 'end_time' => 1050.98, 'target_text' => 'My beloved children, my beloved youth, my mothers, my sisters, my brothers, my elders, whoever you are, let\'s do better than', 'source_text' => 'Wahai anak-anakku yang dikasihi, para pemuda, ibu-ibuku, para saudariku, para saudaraku, para wargatua sekalian, sesiapa jua anda — marilah kita beramal lebih baik daripada', 'order' => 309],
            ['start_time' => 1051.08, 'end_time' => 1052.18, 'target_text' => 'we did yesterday.', 'source_text' => 'apa yang kita lakukan semalam.', 'order' => 310],
            ['start_time' => 1052.28, 'end_time' => 1053.9, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s always be stronger.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah kita sentiasa menjadi insan yang lebih teguh.', 'order' => 311],
            ['start_time' => 1054.0, 'end_time' => 1060.9, 'target_text' => 'It is very sad to see people sometimes they are closer to Allah and then they become distant.', 'source_text' => 'Amat mendukacitakan apabila melihat orang yang dahulunya begitu dekat dengan Allah, kemudiannya menjauhkan diri.', 'order' => 312],
            ['start_time' => 1061.0, 'end_time' => 1062.34, 'target_text' => 'That\'s not a good sign.', 'source_text' => 'Itu bukan petanda yang baik.', 'order' => 313],
            ['start_time' => 1062.44, 'end_time' => 1069.94, 'target_text' => 'I say if you\'re going to sin, don\'t encourage others to sin because you might quit the sin at some point and those whom you\'ve', 'source_text' => 'Saya berpesan, sekiranya anda terlanjur melakukan dosa, jangan sesekali mengajak orang lain berbuat dosa kerana anda mungkin bertaubat suatu hari nanti, sedangkan orang yang', 'order' => 314],
            ['start_time' => 1070.04, 'end_time' => 1075.16, 'target_text' => 'encouraged might become sadaka in the wrong sense.', 'source_text' => 'anda pengaruhi itu mungkin menjadi \'sedekah jariah\' pada jalan keburukan.', 'order' => 315],
            ['start_time' => 1075.52, 'end_time' => 1077.1, 'target_text' => 'What is a sadaka in the wrong sense?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang dimaksudkan dengan \'sedekah jariah\' pada jalan keburukan?', 'order' => 316],
            ['start_time' => 1077.2, 'end_time' => 1084.22, 'target_text' => 'In the same way I would get a reward for doing a good deed, I will also be sinful for doing a bad deed, but if my good deed', 'source_text' => 'Sebagaimana saya beroleh pahala apabila melakukan kebaikan, saya juga menanggung dosa apabila melakukan maksiat. Namun sekiranya amalan baik saya', 'order' => 317],
            ['start_time' => 1084.32, 'end_time' => 1089.62, 'target_text' => 'encouraged others to do good, I will continue to get a good deed for as long as they did the good.', 'source_text' => 'mendorong orang lain turut berbuat baik, saya akan terus menerima pahala kebaikan itu selagi mana mereka mengamalkannya.', 'order' => 318],
            ['start_time' => 1089.72, 'end_time' => 1098.06, 'target_text' => 'And if my bad deed encouraged others to do bad, I will continue to receive a sin for as long as they did bad because of them', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya perbuatan buruk saya mendorong orang lain melakukan kemungkaran, saya akan berterusan menanggung dosa selagi mana mereka berbuat jahat kerana', 'order' => 319],
            ['start_time' => 1098.16, 'end_time' => 1099.18, 'target_text' => 'watching me.', 'source_text' => 'melihat perbuatan saya.', 'order' => 320],
            ['start_time' => 1099.28, 'end_time' => 1106.46, 'target_text' => 'Woman sunna sunnatan sayyi\'atan falahu izruha wa wizru man \'amila biha ila yawmil qiyamati.', 'source_text' => 'Wa man sanna sunnatan sayyi\'atan fa \'alayhi wizruha wa wizru man \'amila biha ila yawmil qiyamah.', 'order' => 321],
            ['start_time' => 1106.56, 'end_time' => 1110.22, 'target_text' => 'La yanqusu dhalika min awzarihim shay\'.', 'source_text' => 'La yanqusu dhalika min awzarihim shay\'a.', 'order' => 322],
            ['start_time' => 1110.32, 'end_time' => 1116.1, 'target_text' => 'Very scary hadith where the Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam says, firstly he speaks about those who set a good example,', 'source_text' => 'Sebuah hadis yang amat menggetarkan hati di mana Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam bersabda — pertamanya Baginda menyebut tentang mereka yang menunjukkan teladan yang baik,', 'order' => 323],
            ['start_time' => 1116.2, 'end_time' => 1121.34, 'target_text' => 'they get a reward for the for the deed they did and they get a reward for everyone who followed that good deed.', 'source_text' => 'mereka beroleh ganjaran pahala atas amalan yang dilakukan dan pahala bagi setiap insan yang mencontohi amalan soleh tersebut.', 'order' => 324],
            ['start_time' => 1121.44, 'end_time' => 1128.5, 'target_text' => 'But those who set a bad example, they receive a sin for that particular example they set and they get a sin for everyone who', 'source_text' => 'Sebaliknya mereka yang memulakan contoh teladan yang buruk, mereka menanggung dosa atas amalan buruk yang dimulakan dan menanggung dosa setiap insan yang', 'order' => 325],
            ['start_time' => 1128.6, 'end_time' => 1130.78, 'target_text' => 'followed it from them.', 'source_text' => 'mengikutinya selepas mereka.', 'order' => 326],
            ['start_time' => 1130.88, 'end_time' => 1135.06, 'target_text' => 'So I say my brothers, when you are smoking your weed,', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu saya berpesan, wahai saudaraku, sekiranya anda sedang menghisap ganja sekalipun,', 'order' => 327],
            ['start_time' => 1135.16, 'end_time' => 1137.78, 'target_text' => 'feel it within your heart, I need to quit this habit.', 'source_text' => 'sematkanlah rasa keinsafan di dalam lubuk hati anda bahawa, "Aku mesti meninggalkan tabiat buruk ini."', 'order' => 328],
            ['start_time' => 1137.88, 'end_time' => 1142.82, 'target_text' => 'But don\'t ever call the other youngsters who are innocent and doing nothing, "Guys, do you know what this is all about?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jangan sesekali anda mengajak anak-anak muda lain yang suci dan tidak tahu apa-apa dengan berkata, "Kawan-kawan, tahu tak benda ini macam mana rasanya?', 'order' => 329],
            ['start_time' => 1142.92, 'end_time' => 1143.98, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s try it out, guys.', 'source_text' => 'Jomlah cuba sama-sama.', 'order' => 330],
            ['start_time' => 1144.08, 'end_time' => 1145.06, 'target_text' => 'It\'s quite good.', 'source_text' => 'Rasanya memang best.', 'order' => 331],
            ['start_time' => 1145.16, 'end_time' => 1148.9, 'target_text' => 'You know, no one who smoked weed died in Corona.', 'source_text' => 'Tahu tak, sesiapa yang hisap ganja langsung tak mati masa musim wabak Corona dulu.', 'order' => 332],
            ['start_time' => 1149.0, 'end_time' => 1152.7, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what they say." La hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah dakwaan mereka." La hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'order' => 333],
            ['start_time' => 1152.8, 'end_time' => 1153.62, 'target_text' => 'Have you ever heard that?', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah anda mendengar alasan sebegini?', 'order' => 334],
            ['start_time' => 1153.72, 'end_time' => 1155.18, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak.', 'order' => 335],
            ['start_time' => 1155.28, 'end_time' => 1156.98, 'target_text' => 'I\'m glad you haven\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bersyukur anda tidak pernah mendengarnya.', 'order' => 336],
            ['start_time' => 1157.08, 'end_time' => 1158.34, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s not true.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana ia sama sekali tidak benar.', 'order' => 337],
            ['start_time' => 1158.44, 'end_time' => 1161.26, 'target_text' => 'But that\'s what they were claiming in order to get others on weed.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi itulah helah yang mereka cipta semata-mata untuk menjerumuskan orang lain ke kancah ketagihan ganja.', 'order' => 338],
            ['start_time' => 1161.36, 'end_time' => 1163.86, 'target_text' => 'I say, but why are you on weed now suddenly?', 'source_text' => 'Saya bertanya, "Tetapi mengapa tiba-tiba sekarang kamu menghisap ganja?"', 'order' => 339],
            ['start_time' => 1163.96, 'end_time' => 1164.94, 'target_text' => 'Before they used to hide it.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu mereka menyembunyikannya.', 'order' => 340],
            ['start_time' => 1165.04, 'end_time' => 1166.9, 'target_text' => 'Now they say, "Sheikh, you know, I have one weakness.', 'source_text' => 'Kini dengan selamba mereka berkata, "Syeikh, saya ada satu kelemahan.', 'order' => 341],
            ['start_time' => 1167.0, 'end_time' => 1169.5, 'target_text' => 'I\'m just on weed." La ilaha illallah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya cuma hisap ganja saja." La ilaha illallah.', 'order' => 342],
            ['start_time' => 1169.6, 'end_time' => 1170.86, 'target_text' => 'Keep it away from who am I?', 'source_text' => 'Jauhkanlah pengakuan itu daripada saya, siapalah saya ini?', 'order' => 343],
            ['start_time' => 1170.96, 'end_time' => 1171.66, 'target_text' => 'I\'m not your Lord.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bukan Tuhan kamu.', 'order' => 344],
            ['start_time' => 1171.76, 'end_time' => 1172.82, 'target_text' => 'Why do you have to tell me?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa kamu perlu mengaku dosa kepada saya?', 'order' => 345],
            ['start_time' => 1172.92, 'end_time' => 1174.14, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t have to confess to me.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu tidak perlu meluahkan pengakuan dosa kepada saya.', 'order' => 346],
            ['start_time' => 1174.24, 'end_time' => 1175.1, 'target_text' => 'This is Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah agama Islam.', 'order' => 347],
            ['start_time' => 1175.2, 'end_time' => 1178.58, 'target_text' => 'In Islam, confession is only to your Lord, not to anyone else.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam Islam, pengakuan dosa hanyalah semata-mata kepada Tuhanmu, bukan kepada mana-mana makhluk lain.', 'order' => 348],
            ['start_time' => 1178.68, 'end_time' => 1179.86, 'target_text' => 'You want help, go and seek it.', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda memerlukan rawatan dan pertolongan, pergilah dapatkannya.', 'order' => 349],
            ['start_time' => 1179.96, 'end_time' => 1182.18, 'target_text' => 'But don\'t come and say proudly that you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jangan datang dan bercakap dengan rasa megah bahawa tahukah anda?', 'order' => 350],
            ['start_time' => 1182.28, 'end_time' => 1183.18, 'target_text' => 'I just have one addiction.', 'source_text' => '"Saya cuma ada satu ketagihan saja.', 'order' => 351],
            ['start_time' => 1183.28, 'end_time' => 1184.82, 'target_text' => 'I\'m addicted to zina.', 'source_text' => 'Saya cuma ketagih berzina."', 'order' => 352],
            ['start_time' => 1184.92, 'end_time' => 1186.74, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t have to tell I just have.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak perlu berkata, "Saya cuma ada."', 'order' => 353],
            ['start_time' => 1186.84, 'end_time' => 1189.26, 'target_text' => 'That just have is an insult to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Perkataan \'cuma ada\' itu adalah suatu penghinaan terhadap kemurkaan Allah.', 'order' => 354],
            ['start_time' => 1189.36, 'end_time' => 1190.14, 'target_text' => 'How can you say that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana anda sanggup memperkecilkan dosa sedemikian?', 'order' => 355],
            ['start_time' => 1190.24, 'end_time' => 1192.28, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a sin.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah suatu perbuatan dosa.', 'order' => 356],
            ['start_time' => 1194.32, 'end_time' => 1195.34, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a massive sin.', 'source_text' => 'Ia suatu dosa yang teramat besar.', 'order' => 357],
            ['start_time' => 1195.44, 'end_time' => 1197.5, 'target_text' => 'You think it\'s small, but no, it isn\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menyangkanya perkara kecil, hakikatnya tidak sama sekali.', 'order' => 358],
            ['start_time' => 1197.6, 'end_time' => 1200.7, 'target_text' => 'So, we ask Allah to strengthen us and to grant us goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, kita memohon kepada Allah agar mengurniakan kita kekuatan dan melimpahkan kebaikan kepada kita.', 'order' => 359],
            ['start_time' => 1200.8, 'end_time' => 1205.14, 'target_text' => 'When you have removed your hijab, for example, don\'t encourage others to do that.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda membuka hijab anda, sebagai contoh, janganlah mengajak wanita lain melakukan perkara yang sama.', 'order' => 360],
            ['start_time' => 1205.24, 'end_time' => 1210.22, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t display it and tell people, "Guys, I took it off because, you know, I don\'t think this and don\'t think that." There', 'source_text' => 'Jangan menunjukkannya di media sosial dan memberitahu orang ramai, "Kawan-kawan, saya buka tudung sebab saya fikir begini dan begitu." Pasti', 'order' => 361],
            ['start_time' => 1210.32, 'end_time' => 1212.78, 'target_text' => 'will be people who did not doubt at all.', 'source_text' => 'ada insan yang asalnya langsung tiada rasa ragu-ragu terhadap kewajipan bertudung.', 'order' => 362],
            ['start_time' => 1212.88, 'end_time' => 1219.46, 'target_text' => 'When you instill the doubt, one day, 10 years down the line, and I have seen this, when you don the hijab again, but they', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila anda menyemai keraguan itu, suatu hari nanti 10 tahun akan datang — dan saya pernah menyaksikan sendiri perkara ini — apabila anda memakai semula hijab tetapi mereka', 'order' => 363],
            ['start_time' => 1219.56, 'end_time' => 1222.74, 'target_text' => 'all went astray because of you, what\'s going to happen?', 'source_text' => 'semua telah tersesat jalan disebabkan kata-kata anda dahulu, apakah yang bakal terjadi?', 'order' => 364],
            ['start_time' => 1222.84, 'end_time' => 1224.7, 'target_text' => 'We hope and pray that Allah forgive you.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sentiasa berharap dan berdoa semoga Allah mengampunkan anda.', 'order' => 365],
            ['start_time' => 1224.8, 'end_time' => 1226.38, 'target_text' => 'And Allah forgive all of us.', 'source_text' => 'Dan semoga Allah mengampunkan dosa kita semua.', 'order' => 366],
            ['start_time' => 1226.48, 'end_time' => 1232.32, 'target_text' => 'So, I have a very, very interesting encouragement for you tonight.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, saya mempunyai satu peringatan dan motivasi yang amat menarik untuk anda pada malam ini.', 'order' => 367],
            ['start_time' => 1232.48, 'end_time' => 1233.7, 'target_text' => 'I want to change my life.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin mengubah hidup saya.', 'order' => 368],
            ['start_time' => 1233.8, 'end_time' => 1235.06, 'target_text' => 'I want to make it better.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mahu menjadikannya lebih baik.', 'order' => 369],
            ['start_time' => 1235.16, 'end_time' => 1237.5, 'target_text' => 'I want to get closer to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mahu mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 370],
            ['start_time' => 1237.6, 'end_time' => 1240.1, 'target_text' => 'Any one of us could say this, and we should be saying this.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap daripada kita mampu mengucapkan tekad ini, dan sememangnya kita patut melafazkannya.', 'order' => 371],
            ['start_time' => 1240.2, 'end_time' => 1241.42, 'target_text' => 'I want to become better.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mahu menjadi insan yang lebih baik.', 'order' => 372],
            ['start_time' => 1241.52, 'end_time' => 1242.58, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve committed sins.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah melakukan dosa.', 'order' => 373],
            ['start_time' => 1242.68, 'end_time' => 1244.78, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve done a lot of wrong things in my life.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah melakukan pelbagai kesilapan sepanjang hidup saya.', 'order' => 374],
            ['start_time' => 1244.88, 'end_time' => 1249.9, 'target_text' => 'I am at a position in my life where I feel that perhaps I might die anytime.', 'source_text' => 'Kini saya berada pada fasa kehidupan di mana saya merasakan mungkin maut boleh menjemput saya pada bila-bila masa.', 'order' => 375],
            ['start_time' => 1250.0, 'end_time' => 1250.54, 'target_text' => 'You never know.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak pernah tahu.', 'order' => 376],
            ['start_time' => 1250.64, 'end_time' => 1257.9, 'target_text' => 'There are healthy people, fit people who go to the gym regularly, who are eating healthy, and suddenly, 35, 40 years old,', 'source_text' => 'Ada orang yang sihat tubuh badan, cergas dan kerap bersenam di gimnasium, menjaga pemakanan yang sihat, tiba-tiba pada usia 35 atau 40 tahun,', 'order' => 377],
            ['start_time' => 1258.0, 'end_time' => 1260.14, 'target_text' => 'heart attack, boom, and they\'re gone back to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'diserang sakit jantung, terus menghembuskan nafas terakhir dan kembali menemui Allah.', 'order' => 378],
            ['start_time' => 1260.24, 'end_time' => 1261.82, 'target_text' => 'And one wonders what their condition is.', 'source_text' => 'Dan orang tertanya-tanya bagaimanakah keadaan kesudahan mereka.', 'order' => 379],
            ['start_time' => 1261.92, 'end_time' => 1264.94, 'target_text' => 'May Allah make it easy for us the day he takes us away.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mempermudahkan urusan kita pada hari Dia mengambil kembali nyawa kita.', 'order' => 380],
            ['start_time' => 1265.04, 'end_time' => 1273.54, 'target_text' => 'But I need to ensure that I become better because with your intention and the strength and power of your intention, Allah', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya mesti memastikan bahawa saya berusaha menjadi lebih baik, kerana dengan keikhlasan niat serta kekuatan tekad anda, Allah', 'order' => 381],
            ['start_time' => 1273.64, 'end_time' => 1282.34, 'target_text' => 'will grant you paradise even if you did not complete the circle and the circuit that you intended to compete at the to complete.', 'source_text' => 'akan mengurniakan syurga kepada anda sekalipun anda belum sempat menyempurnakan seluruh perancangan ibadah yang anda azamkan.', 'order' => 382],
            ['start_time' => 1282.44, 'end_time' => 1288.94, 'target_text' => 'If I intend to become a half a and I started today and I learned a small portion every day and I was moving forward and one', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya berniat untuk menjadi seorang hafiz dan saya memulakannya hari ini dengan menghafal sedikit demi sedikit setiap hari, dan saya terus melangkah ke hadapan namun suatu', 'order' => 383],
            ['start_time' => 1289.04, 'end_time' => 1296.22, 'target_text' => 'day I died, Allah will write my name among the huffaz and those who memorized the Quran even though I only did five Jews.', 'source_text' => 'hari saya meninggal dunia, Allah tetap akan mencatatkan nama saya dalam kalangan para huffaz dan mereka yang menghafal al-Quran walaupun saya baru sempat menghafal lima juzuk.', 'order' => 384],
            ['start_time' => 1296.32, 'end_time' => 1303.3, 'target_text' => 'For as long as there was intention, I started it, I continued it and the only thing that stopped me was death.', 'source_text' => 'Selagi mana ada keikhlasan niat, saya telah memulakannya, saya berterusan melakukannya dan satu-satunya perkara yang menghentikan saya hanyalah ajal maut,', 'order' => 385],
            ['start_time' => 1303.4, 'end_time' => 1304.38, 'target_text' => 'Allah will write it for you.', 'source_text' => 'Allah pasti akan mencatatkan pahala penuh itu untuk anda.', 'order' => 386],
            ['start_time' => 1304.48, 'end_time' => 1309.9, 'target_text' => 'There\'s no doubt because Allah says he will judge you by your intentions and this was the intention.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada keraguan padanya kerana Allah berfirman bahawa Dia menilai kamu berdasarkan niatmu, dan itulah niat sebenar kamu.', 'order' => 387],
            ['start_time' => 1310.0, 'end_time' => 1317.82, 'target_text' => 'Similarly, when a person comes for salah every day and he fulfills his prayer say Fajr in a certain place, the day he is sick', 'source_text' => 'Begitu juga halnya apabila seseorang istiqamah menunaikan solat berjemaah setiap hari, katakanlah solat Subuh di tempat tertentu, pada hari dia jatuh sakit', 'order' => 388],
            ['start_time' => 1317.92, 'end_time' => 1321.98, 'target_text' => 'and ill, he may do it somewhere at home or whatever it might be, but guess what?', 'source_text' => 'dan uzur, dia mungkin menunaikannya di rumah atau di mana sahaja, tetapi tahukah anda apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 389],
            ['start_time' => 1322.08, 'end_time' => 1329.1, 'target_text' => 'The angels will write him having attended that particular salah in the masjid simply because the only thing that stopped him', 'source_text' => 'Para malaikat tetap akan mencatatkannya seolah-olah dia hadir menunaikan solat berjemaah di masjid tersebut, semata-mata kerana satu-satunya penghalang', 'order' => 390],
            ['start_time' => 1329.2, 'end_time' => 1332.74, 'target_text' => 'from coming there was a sickness that he had no control over.', 'source_text' => 'yang menyebabkannya tidak dapat hadir adalah keuzuran yang di luar kawalannya.', 'order' => 391],
            ['start_time' => 1332.84, 'end_time' => 1334.42, 'target_text' => 'Allah says we write for you that deed.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: Kami tetap mencatatkan ganjaran amalan itu untukmu.', 'order' => 392],
            ['start_time' => 1334.52, 'end_time' => 1335.46, 'target_text' => 'Who is Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah Allah?', 'order' => 393],
            ['start_time' => 1335.56, 'end_time' => 1337.66, 'target_text' => 'Allah is the most honorable.', 'source_text' => 'Allah adalah Yang Maha Mulia.', 'order' => 394],
            ['start_time' => 1337.76, 'end_time' => 1339.62, 'target_text' => 'Allah is the most generous.', 'source_text' => 'Allah adalah Yang Maha Pemurah.', 'order' => 395],
            ['start_time' => 1339.72, 'end_time' => 1340.54, 'target_text' => 'The most generous.', 'source_text' => 'Zat Yang Maha Mengurniakan.', 'order' => 396],
            ['start_time' => 1340.64, 'end_time' => 1341.54, 'target_text' => 'You think you are generous.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menyangka diri anda pemurah.', 'order' => 397],
            ['start_time' => 1341.64, 'end_time' => 1342.66, 'target_text' => 'You know what Allah does?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang Allah lakukan?', 'order' => 398],
            ['start_time' => 1342.76, 'end_time' => 1345.3, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Okay, you sinned all your life.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Baiklah, kamu pernah berbuat dosa sepanjang hidupmu.', 'order' => 399],
            ['start_time' => 1345.4, 'end_time' => 1351.22, 'target_text' => 'Then there came a time when either you went for Hajj or Umrah or something happened, whatever happened and you changed your', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian tiba suatu saat di mana sama ada kamu menunaikan haji, umrah, atau berlaku sesuatu peristiwa yang menyedarkan kamu, apa jua yang berlaku lalu kamu mengubah', 'order' => 400],
            ['start_time' => 1351.32, 'end_time' => 1354.06, 'target_text' => 'life and you came back and you quit your sins.', 'source_text' => 'cara hidup kamu dan kamu kembali serta meninggalkan dosa-dosa kamu.', 'order' => 401],
            ['start_time' => 1354.16, 'end_time' => 1358.02, 'target_text' => 'Nothing made you quit them besides me, besides Allah meaning.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada apa yang membuatkan kamu meninggalkannya melainkan Aku — yakni kerana Allah semata-mata.', 'order' => 402],
            ['start_time' => 1358.12, 'end_time' => 1363.14, 'target_text' => 'Nothing made you quit besides Allah and you changed your life and you started doing good deeds for my pleasure.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada apa yang mendorong kamu berhenti melainkan Allah, lalu kamu mengubah hidupmu dan mula beramal soleh demi mencari keredaan-Ku.', 'order' => 403],
            ['start_time' => 1363.24, 'end_time' => 1369.5, 'target_text' => 'I want to tell you what I\'m going to do for you, a bonus." At the in the Quran, Allah tells us, "I will take those bad deeds', 'source_text' => 'Aku ingin memberitahu kamu apa yang akan Aku kurniakan kepadamu, suatu ganjaran bonus." Di dalam al-Quran, Allah memberitahu kita, "Aku akan mengambil amalan buruk itu', 'order' => 404],
            ['start_time' => 1369.6, 'end_time' => 1375.7, 'target_text' => 'and I will put them on the right side of the scale and consider them as good deeds even though they were done as bad deeds."', 'source_text' => 'dan meletakkannya di sebelah kanan timbangan mizan lalu mengira semuanya sebagai amalan kebajikan, sekalipun dahulu ia dilakukan sebagai kemungkaran."', 'order' => 405],
            ['start_time' => 1375.8, 'end_time' => 1378.74, 'target_text' => 'Can there be anyone more generous than Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah sesiapa yang lebih pemurah daripada Allah?', 'order' => 406],
            ['start_time' => 1378.84, 'end_time' => 1379.94, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sesiapa.', 'order' => 407],
            ['start_time' => 1380.04, 'end_time' => 1381.84, 'target_text' => 'Illuminata', 'source_text' => 'Illa man taba...', 'order' => 408],
            ['start_time' => 1400.48, 'end_time' => 1401.9, 'target_text' => 'What a beautiful verse.', 'source_text' => 'Betapa indahnya ayat al-Quran ini.', 'order' => 409],
            ['start_time' => 1402.0, 'end_time' => 1403.62, 'target_text' => 'Surat al-Furqan, right at the end.', 'source_text' => 'Surah al-Furqan, betul-betul di bahagian penghujungnya.', 'order' => 410],
            ['start_time' => 1403.72, 'end_time' => 1406.9, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Hey, we will punish those who do bad.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Ketahuilah, Kami akan mengazab mereka yang berbuat kejahatan.', 'order' => 411],
            ['start_time' => 1407.0, 'end_time' => 1415.02, 'target_text' => 'We will multiply the punishment for some, but as for those who repented and did good deeds thereafter, we will convert their', 'source_text' => 'Kami akan melipatgandakan azab bagi sebahagian orang, namun bagi sesiapa yang bertaubat dan beramal soleh selepas itu, Kami akan menukar', 'order' => 412],
            ['start_time' => 1415.12, 'end_time' => 1417.06, 'target_text' => 'bad deeds into good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'keburukan mereka menjadi amalan-amalan kebajikan."', 'order' => 413],
            ['start_time' => 1417.16, 'end_time' => 1420.42, 'target_text' => 'When you go on the day of qiyamah, you see so many good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda dibangkitkan pada hari kiamat, anda melihat begitu banyak pahala amalan kebaikan.', 'order' => 414],
            ['start_time' => 1420.52, 'end_time' => 1421.7, 'target_text' => 'What is this, oh Allah?', 'source_text' => '"Apakah semua ini, ya Allah?"', 'order' => 415],
            ['start_time' => 1421.8, 'end_time' => 1425.06, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "You changed your life, and you came back to me.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Kamu telah mengubah hidupmu dan kembali kepada-Ku.', 'order' => 416],
            ['start_time' => 1425.16, 'end_time' => 1432.98, 'target_text' => 'I had to change all your bad deeds into good because the only thing that stopped you from continuing that was my love and', 'source_text' => 'Maka Aku menukar segala dosa keburukanmu menjadi pahala kebaikan kerana satu-satunya perkara yang menghentikan kamu daripada meneruskannya adalah rasa cinta dan', 'order' => 417],
            ['start_time' => 1433.08, 'end_time' => 1434.06, 'target_text' => 'my connection.', 'source_text' => 'hubunganmu dengan-Ku.', 'order' => 418],
            ['start_time' => 1434.16, 'end_time' => 1434.7, 'target_text' => 'That\'s it.', 'source_text' => 'Itu sahaja puncanya.', 'order' => 419],
            ['start_time' => 1434.8, 'end_time' => 1436.46, 'target_text' => 'For that, I give you the bonus.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana sebab itulah, Aku mengurniakan kamu ganjaran bonus ini."', 'order' => 420],
            ['start_time' => 1436.56, 'end_time' => 1437.54, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 421],
            ['start_time' => 1437.64, 'end_time' => 1438.04, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 422],
            ['start_time' => 1438.12, 'end_time' => 1439.1, 'target_text' => 'That\'s Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sifat Maha Pengasih Allah.', 'order' => 423],
            ['start_time' => 1439.2, 'end_time' => 1440.7, 'target_text' => 'Now, wouldn\'t we love that?', 'source_text' => 'Tidakkah kita mendambakan kurniaan seindah itu?', 'order' => 424],
            ['start_time' => 1440.8, 'end_time' => 1442.06, 'target_text' => 'What is Allah asking of you?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang Allah tuntut daripada diri anda?', 'order' => 425],
            ['start_time' => 1442.16, 'end_time' => 1443.54, 'target_text' => 'What does Islam say?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah seruan ajaran Islam?', 'order' => 426],
            ['start_time' => 1443.64, 'end_time' => 1445.18, 'target_text' => 'Why is there an attack on Islam?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa sentiasa ada serangan dan tohmahan terhadap Islam?', 'order' => 427],
            ['start_time' => 1445.28, 'end_time' => 1449.22, 'target_text' => 'Because Islam is the only religion that promotes', 'source_text' => 'Kerana Islam adalah satu-satunya agama yang mengangkat', 'order' => 428],
            ['start_time' => 1449.32, 'end_time' => 1452.38, 'target_text' => 'the highest of values and morals.', 'source_text' => 'nilai-nilai akhlak dan moral yang paling murni lagi terpuji.', 'order' => 429],
            ['start_time' => 1452.48, 'end_time' => 1456.22, 'target_text' => 'And your connection with your maker alone and the one whom you\'re going to go back to.', 'source_text' => 'Serta memelihara hubunganmu dengan Penciptamu semata-mata, Zat yang kepada-Nya jua kamu bakal dikembalikan.', 'order' => 430],
            ['start_time' => 1456.32, 'end_time' => 1458.5, 'target_text' => 'Look, I might be a famous person.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah, saya mungkin seorang yang terkenal.', 'order' => 431],
            ['start_time' => 1458.6, 'end_time' => 1459.82, 'target_text' => 'I want to tell you something.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin berkongsi sesuatu dengan anda.', 'order' => 432],
            ['start_time' => 1459.92, 'end_time' => 1462.3, 'target_text' => 'Fame means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Populariti itu langsung tiada nilai.', 'order' => 433],
            ['start_time' => 1462.4, 'end_time' => 1463.9, 'target_text' => 'It means zero.', 'source_text' => 'Nilainya sifar di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 434],
            ['start_time' => 1464.0, 'end_time' => 1467.26, 'target_text' => 'The worst from among humankind are probably also famous.', 'source_text' => 'Makhluk yang paling jahat dalam kalangan umat manusia juga mungkin sangat terkenal.', 'order' => 435],
            ['start_time' => 1467.36, 'end_time' => 1469.18, 'target_text' => 'Shaitan is absolutely famous.', 'source_text' => 'Syaitan adalah makhluk yang tersangat popular.', 'order' => 436],
            ['start_time' => 1469.28, 'end_time' => 1470.66, 'target_text' => 'Do you know that?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda hakikat itu?', 'order' => 437],
            ['start_time' => 1470.76, 'end_time' => 1472.66, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 438],
            ['start_time' => 1472.76, 'end_time' => 1474.42, 'target_text' => 'How many of you have heard of Shaitan?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai antara anda yang pernah mendengar nama Syaitan?', 'order' => 439],
            ['start_time' => 1474.52, 'end_time' => 1476.26, 'target_text' => 'Put up your hands.', 'source_text' => 'Sila angkat tangan anda.', 'order' => 440],
            ['start_time' => 1476.36, 'end_time' => 1477.46, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the whole masjid.', 'source_text' => 'Satu masjid semuanya mengangkat tangan.', 'order' => 441],
            ['start_time' => 1477.56, 'end_time' => 1480.06, 'target_text' => 'Isn\'t Shaitan more famous than you and I?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah Syaitan jauh lebih terkenal daripada anda dan saya?', 'order' => 442],
            ['start_time' => 1480.16, 'end_time' => 1482.74, 'target_text' => 'Does it make him a big rock star or something?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah populariti itu menjadikannya seorang bintang hebat atau tokoh mulia?', 'order' => 443],
            ['start_time' => 1482.84, 'end_time' => 1484.26, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 444],
            ['start_time' => 1484.36, 'end_time' => 1486.78, 'target_text' => 'Some of the most famous people are some of the worst.', 'source_text' => 'Sesetengah manusia yang paling terkenal di dunia adalah antara makhluk yang paling buruk perilakunya.', 'order' => 445],
            ['start_time' => 1486.88, 'end_time' => 1490.62, 'target_text' => 'So, for me to be famous, it means nothing in the eyes of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, bagi diri saya menjadi terkenal, ia langsung tiada erti di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 446],
            ['start_time' => 1490.72, 'end_time' => 1493.66, 'target_text' => 'La yaswa indallahi janaha ba\'udah.', 'source_text' => 'La yaswa \'indallahi janaha ba\'udah — tidak bernilai walau seberat sayap nyamuk.', 'order' => 447],
            ['start_time' => 1493.76, 'end_time' => 1495.46, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, I\'m telling you it means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, saya berterus-terang kepada anda bahawa kemasyhuran itu tiada nilai.', 'order' => 448],
            ['start_time' => 1495.56, 'end_time' => 1499.62, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m sitting here and I bring you closer to me, I\'ve lost.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya duduk di sini dan sekadar menarik anda mengagumi diri saya, sesungguhnya saya adalah insan yang rugi.', 'order' => 449],
            ['start_time' => 1499.72, 'end_time' => 1506.06, 'target_text' => 'But if I\'m sitting here and I remind you of Allah, only on the day of judgement we will see what happened.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi sekiranya saya duduk di sini dan mengingatkan anda kembali kepada Allah, hanya pada hari perhitungan kelak kita akan melihat apa hasilnya.', 'order' => 450],
            ['start_time' => 1506.16, 'end_time' => 1507.42, 'target_text' => 'Only on the day of judgement.', 'source_text' => 'Hanya pada hari pengadilan kelak.', 'order' => 451],
            ['start_time' => 1507.52, 'end_time' => 1510.34, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be deceived by the likes and the follows.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan sesekali anda terpedaya dengan jumlah \'likes\' dan pengikut di media sosial.', 'order' => 452],
            ['start_time' => 1510.44, 'end_time' => 1515.78, 'target_text' => 'I\'m telling you sitting from a position of a person who has a lot of likes and follows.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bercakap kepada anda dari posisi seseorang yang memiliki jumlah \'likes\' dan jutaan pengikut.', 'order' => 453],
            ['start_time' => 1515.88, 'end_time' => 1518.46, 'target_text' => 'And I want to tell you it means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya ingin menegaskan bahawa semua itu langsung tiada nilai hakiki.', 'order' => 454],
            ['start_time' => 1518.56, 'end_time' => 1526.66, 'target_text' => 'Those who are enslaved by the likes and follows, they will never taste contentment on earth, I guarantee you.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka yang menjadi hamba kepada \'likes\' dan jumlah pengikut, saya jamin mereka tidak akan pernah mengecap kemanisan ketenangan hidup di dunia ini.', 'order' => 455],
            ['start_time' => 1526.76, 'end_time' => 1531.86, 'target_text' => 'Because not a moment did Allah say that your contentment lies in likes and follows.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana tidak sedetik pun Allah menjanjikan bahawa ketenangan jiwa anda terletak pada jumlah \'likes\' dan pengikut.', 'order' => 456],
            ['start_time' => 1531.96, 'end_time' => 1534.58, 'target_text' => 'In order to get likes and follows, do you know what you need to do?', 'source_text' => 'Demi meraih \'likes\' dan pengikut hari ini, tahukah anda apa yang sanggup sesetengah orang lakukan?', 'order' => 457],
            ['start_time' => 1534.68, 'end_time' => 1536.82, 'target_text' => 'You need to do the silliest of things.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu melakukan perkara-perkara yang paling mengarut dan bodoh.', 'order' => 458],
            ['start_time' => 1536.92, 'end_time' => 1538.22, 'target_text' => 'The silliest of things.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang paling tidak masuk akal.', 'order' => 459],
            ['start_time' => 1538.32, 'end_time' => 1541.22, 'target_text' => 'You need to follow trends that don\'t make sense.', 'source_text' => 'Anda terpaksa meniru ikutan trend yang langsung tiada faedah.', 'order' => 460],
            ['start_time' => 1541.32, 'end_time' => 1544.82, 'target_text' => 'And you need to 67 your entire life.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda perlu membazirkan masa hidup anda dengan trend karut seperti 67.', 'order' => 461],
            ['start_time' => 1544.92, 'end_time' => 1546.94, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 462],
            ['start_time' => 1547.04, 'end_time' => 1549.46, 'target_text' => 'See, the kids knew what I was What did I say?', 'source_text' => 'Lihat, anak-anak kecil ini faham apa yang saya sebutkan tadi. Apa yang saya sebut tadi?', 'order' => 463],
            ['start_time' => 1549.56, 'end_time' => 1551.14, 'target_text' => '67.', 'source_text' => '67.', 'order' => 464],
            ['start_time' => 1551.24, 'end_time' => 1552.78, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 465],
            ['start_time' => 1552.88, 'end_time' => 1553.58, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 466],
            ['start_time' => 1553.68, 'end_time' => 1554.7, 'target_text' => 'But, what is it?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apakah maknanya?', 'order' => 467],
            ['start_time' => 1554.8, 'end_time' => 1557.26, 'target_text' => 'If I ask you what does 67 mean, they don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya bertanya kepada anda apa maksud 67, mereka sendiri tidak tahu.', 'order' => 468],
            ['start_time' => 1557.36, 'end_time' => 1558.34, 'target_text' => 'No one knows.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sesiapa pun yang tahu.', 'order' => 469],
            ['start_time' => 1558.44, 'end_time' => 1561.42, 'target_text' => 'Even the people who first said 67.', 'source_text' => 'Malah orang yang mula-mula mencipta trend 67 itu pun tidak tahu.', 'order' => 470],
            ['start_time' => 1561.52, 'end_time' => 1562.02, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa yang berlaku seterusnya?', 'order' => 471],
            ['start_time' => 1562.12, 'end_time' => 1564.42, 'target_text' => 'In 2027, they\'re planning to say 78.', 'source_text' => 'Menjelang tahun 2027 kelak, mereka bercadang mencipta trend 78 pula.', 'order' => 472],
            ['start_time' => 1564.52, 'end_time' => 1565.86, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 473],
            ['start_time' => 1565.96, 'end_time' => 1567.5, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 474],
            ['start_time' => 1567.6, 'end_time' => 1569.74, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s life, and that\'s how we will continue.', 'source_text' => 'Begitulah lumrah kehidupan duniawi dan begitulah ia akan berterusan.', 'order' => 475],
            ['start_time' => 1569.84, 'end_time' => 1575.1, 'target_text' => 'So, no matter how much of fun you might have, don\'t ever do it for likes and follows.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, walau sebesar mana sekalipun keseronokan yang anda nikmati, jangan sesekali melakukannya semata-mata demi mengejar \'likes\' dan pengikut.', 'order' => 476],
            ['start_time' => 1575.2, 'end_time' => 1579.4, 'target_text' => 'Another thing is, in order for us today', 'source_text' => 'Satu perkara lagi, demi meraih', 'order' => 477],
            ['start_time' => 1580.24, 'end_time' => 1586.08, 'target_text' => 'to gain likes and follows, many people have to remain on', 'source_text' => '\'likes\' dan pengikut pada hari ini, ramai orang terpaksa bersiaran langsung dalam talian', 'order' => 478],
            ['start_time' => 1586.28, 'end_time' => 1589.5, 'target_text' => 'alive for a long, long time.', 'source_text' => 'secara \'live\' untuk tempoh masa yang sangat lama.', 'order' => 479],
            ['start_time' => 1589.6, 'end_time' => 1590.22, 'target_text' => 'But guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi tahukah anda apa yang menyedihkan?', 'order' => 480],
            ['start_time' => 1590.32, 'end_time' => 1593.06, 'target_text' => 'You were not live with Allah at the time of salah.', 'source_text' => 'Anda langsung tidak \'live\' bersama Allah pada waktu solat fardu.', 'order' => 481],
            ['start_time' => 1593.16, 'end_time' => 1596.42, 'target_text' => 'You were not live with Allah at the time that you needed to be there.', 'source_text' => 'Anda langsung tidak \'live\' bermunajat kepada Allah pada saat-saat genting anda sepatutnya bersujud kepada-Nya.', 'order' => 482],
            ['start_time' => 1596.52, 'end_time' => 1598.26, 'target_text' => 'But you were live with everyone else.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaliknya anda bersiaran \'live\' bersama seluruh manusia lain.', 'order' => 483],
            ['start_time' => 1598.36, 'end_time' => 1600.7, 'target_text' => 'Okay, you got a million followers, big deal.', 'source_text' => 'Baiklah, katakan anda meraih sejuta pengikut, suatu pencapaian besar kononnya.', 'order' => 484],
            ['start_time' => 1600.8, 'end_time' => 1602.22, 'target_text' => 'Big deal for the dunya.', 'source_text' => 'Pencapaian besar untuk urusan duniawi semata-mata.', 'order' => 485],
            ['start_time' => 1602.32, 'end_time' => 1604.3, 'target_text' => 'Will that take you to jannah?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah itu yang bakal memimpin anda ke syurga?', 'order' => 486],
            ['start_time' => 1604.4, 'end_time' => 1606.1, 'target_text' => 'Not at all.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 487],
            ['start_time' => 1606.2, 'end_time' => 1608.78, 'target_text' => 'Unless you reminded them of goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan sekiranya anda memanfaatkan platform itu untuk mengingatkan manusia kepada kebaikan.', 'order' => 488],
            ['start_time' => 1608.88, 'end_time' => 1611.34, 'target_text' => 'Unless you were saying something good.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan jika anda menyampaikan nasihat yang bermanfaat.', 'order' => 489],
            ['start_time' => 1611.44, 'end_time' => 1615.34, 'target_text' => 'Unless you were actually upright and call people towards Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan sekiranya anda benar-benar istiqamah dan mengajak manusia mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 490],
            ['start_time' => 1615.44, 'end_time' => 1618.82, 'target_text' => 'They like you, they don\'t like you is irrelevant.', 'source_text' => 'Sama ada mereka menyukai anda atau membenci anda, itu langsung tidak penting.', 'order' => 491],
            ['start_time' => 1618.92, 'end_time' => 1622.66, 'target_text' => 'Allah will never say how many likes did you have before you go to paradise?', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak akan sesekali bertanya, "Berapa banyakkah \'likes\' yang kamu kumpul sebelum kamu dibenarkan masuk ke syurga?"', 'order' => 492],
            ['start_time' => 1622.76, 'end_time' => 1623.58, 'target_text' => 'No chance.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada kemungkinan sedemikian.', 'order' => 493],
            ['start_time' => 1623.68, 'end_time' => 1624.3, 'target_text' => 'Not at all.', 'source_text' => 'Langsung tidak.', 'order' => 494],
            ['start_time' => 1624.4, 'end_time' => 1625.18, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be deceived.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan biarkan diri anda tertipu.', 'order' => 495],
            ['start_time' => 1625.28, 'end_time' => 1632.18, 'target_text' => 'My beloved youngsters, even if you are unknown, some of the people closest to Allah, they don\'t even have a single account', 'source_text' => 'Wahai anak-anak mudaku yang dikasihi, sekalipun anda langsung tidak dikenali di dunia, ada dalam kalangan insan yang paling dekat kedudukannya dengan Allah, mereka langsung tiada walau satu akaun', 'order' => 496],
            ['start_time' => 1632.28, 'end_time' => 1634.56, 'target_text' => 'on social media.', 'source_text' => 'di media sosial.', 'order' => 497],
            ['start_time' => 1634.76, 'end_time' => 1639.98, 'target_text' => 'And they are so close to Allah that if they were to make a dua, it would come true almost instantly.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kedudukan mereka begitu akrab dengan Allah sehinggakan sekiranya mereka berdoa, doa mereka dimakbulkan dengan serta-merta.', 'order' => 498],
            ['start_time' => 1640.08, 'end_time' => 1642.98, 'target_text' => 'They are certain people mustajabud dawah.', 'source_text' => 'Merekalah golongan insan yang digelar \'mustajabud da\'wah\'.', 'order' => 499],
            ['start_time' => 1643.08, 'end_time' => 1646.22, 'target_text' => 'Is there a single person that Allah says is mustajabud dawah?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah seseorang itu dikira oleh Allah sebagai mustajabud da\'wah', 'order' => 500],
            ['start_time' => 1646.32, 'end_time' => 1650.98, 'target_text' => 'That means when they make a dua and a supplication, it\'s accepted by Allah readily.', 'source_text' => 'Itu bermakna apabila mereka menadah tangan berdoa dan memohon, doa mereka diperkenankan oleh Allah dengan serta-merta.', 'order' => 501],
            ['start_time' => 1651.08, 'end_time' => 1657.3, 'target_text' => 'Is there any one of those with a quality where someone told them the more likes and follows you have, the quicker your dua', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah sesiapa memberitahu mereka bahawa semakin banyak \'likes\' dan pengikut yang kamu miliki, semakin cepat doa kamu', 'order' => 502],
            ['start_time' => 1657.4, 'end_time' => 1658.18, 'target_text' => 'will be accepted?', 'source_text' => 'akan dimakbulkan?', 'order' => 503],
            ['start_time' => 1658.28, 'end_time' => 1659.22, 'target_text' => 'No chance.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 504],
            ['start_time' => 1659.32, 'end_time' => 1660.5, 'target_text' => 'No chance.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada kaitan sama sekali.', 'order' => 505],
            ['start_time' => 1660.6, 'end_time' => 1662.62, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be duped and deceived.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan biarkan diri anda terpedaya dan tertipu.', 'order' => 506],
            ['start_time' => 1662.72, 'end_time' => 1664.42, 'target_text' => 'It is a huge responsibility.', 'source_text' => 'Ia suatu amanah dan tanggungjawab yang amat berat.', 'order' => 507],
            ['start_time' => 1664.52, 'end_time' => 1665.38, 'target_text' => 'Do you know why?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengapa?', 'order' => 508],
            ['start_time' => 1665.48, 'end_time' => 1678.02, 'target_text' => 'My fear is when you forward or like or comment on or promote anything negative, perhaps it is such a huge responsibility that', 'source_text' => 'Kebimbangan terbesar saya adalah apabila anda berkongsi, menekan tanda \'like\', meninggalkan komen atau mempromosikan apa jua perkara mungkar, amanah itu terlalu berat sehingga', 'order' => 509],
            ['start_time' => 1678.12, 'end_time' => 1680.46, 'target_text' => 'that might be our downfall.', 'source_text' => 'ia boleh menjadi punca kebinasaan kita di akhirat kelak.', 'order' => 510],
            ['start_time' => 1680.56, 'end_time' => 1682.06, 'target_text' => 'Look, I want to tell you something.', 'source_text' => 'Dengarlah, saya ingin berkongsi sesuatu yang amat penting dengan anda.', 'order' => 511],
            ['start_time' => 1682.16, 'end_time' => 1684.54, 'target_text' => 'On the day of judgment, we will have a scale.', 'source_text' => 'Pada hari kiamat kelak, akan ada timbangan mizan yang diletakkan.', 'order' => 512],
            ['start_time' => 1684.64, 'end_time' => 1686.1, 'target_text' => 'What type of scale is that?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah bentuk timbangan tersebut?', 'order' => 513],
            ['start_time' => 1686.2, 'end_time' => 1687.82, 'target_text' => 'Anyone tell me?', 'source_text' => 'Ada sesiapa boleh beritahu saya?', 'order' => 514],
            ['start_time' => 1687.92, 'end_time' => 1688.62, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the scale?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah neraca timbangan itu?', 'order' => 515],
            ['start_time' => 1688.72, 'end_time' => 1690.14, 'target_text' => 'Yes, tell me.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, silakan beritahu saya.', 'order' => 516],
            ['start_time' => 1690.24, 'end_time' => 1691.34, 'target_text' => 'Like of good deeds and bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Timbangan amalan baik dan amalan buruk.', 'order' => 517],
            ['start_time' => 1691.44, 'end_time' => 1692.7, 'target_text' => 'Good deeds and bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Amalan kebajikan dan amalan kejahatan.', 'order' => 518],
            ['start_time' => 1692.8, 'end_time' => 1695.74, 'target_text' => 'Which side is the good and which side is the bad?', 'source_text' => 'Sebelah mana diletakkan amalan baik dan sebelah mana diletakkan amalan buruk?', 'order' => 519],
            ['start_time' => 1695.84, 'end_time' => 1697.64, 'target_text' => 'Yes.', 'source_text' => 'Ya.', 'order' => 520],
            ['start_time' => 1698.08, 'end_time' => 1698.7, 'target_text' => 'Right and left.', 'source_text' => 'Kanan dan kiri.', 'order' => 521],
            ['start_time' => 1698.8, 'end_time' => 1699.98, 'target_text' => 'Right is good and left is bad.', 'source_text' => 'Sebelah kanan untuk amalan baik dan sebelah kiri untuk amalan buruk.', 'order' => 522],
            ['start_time' => 1700.08, 'end_time' => 1700.86, 'target_text' => 'Right, correct.', 'source_text' => 'Tepat, jawapan anda betul.', 'order' => 523],
            ['start_time' => 1700.96, 'end_time' => 1703.82, 'target_text' => 'So, imagine you are standing in front of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, bayangkan saat anda sedang berdiri di hadapan Allah.', 'order' => 524],
            ['start_time' => 1703.92, 'end_time' => 1706.5, 'target_text' => 'You are standing, there is a scale, right side, left side.', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang berdiri menghadap neraca timbangan, ada daun timbangan sebelah kanan dan daun timbangan sebelah kiri.', 'order' => 525],
            ['start_time' => 1706.6, 'end_time' => 1708.26, 'target_text' => 'On the right, they\'re going to put all your good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Di sebelah kanan, malaikat akan meletakkan segala amalan soleh anda.', 'order' => 526],
            ['start_time' => 1708.36, 'end_time' => 1710.18, 'target_text' => 'On the bad, they\'re going to put your bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Di sebelah kiri, mereka akan meletakkan segala dosa keburukan anda.', 'order' => 527],
            ['start_time' => 1710.28, 'end_time' => 1714.54, 'target_text' => 'Now, there are so many bad deeds that are going one after the other.', 'source_text' => 'Pada waktu itu, kelihatan begitu banyak dosa keburukan diletakkan satu demi satu.', 'order' => 528],
            ['start_time' => 1714.64, 'end_time' => 1715.42, 'target_text' => 'What will it be?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah bentuk dosa tersebut?', 'order' => 529],
            ['start_time' => 1715.52, 'end_time' => 1717.62, 'target_text' => 'A certain like, you spread a rumor.', 'source_text' => 'Satu tanda \'like\' yang anda berikan ketika menyebarkan fitnah.', 'order' => 530],
            ['start_time' => 1717.72, 'end_time' => 1721.54, 'target_text' => 'You said something negative about someone you don\'t even know.', 'source_text' => 'Kata-kata nista yang anda lontarkan terhadap seseorang yang langsung tidak anda kenali.', 'order' => 531],
            ['start_time' => 1721.64, 'end_time' => 1724.5, 'target_text' => 'It\'s happening every day online.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara itu berlaku setiap hari di alam maya.', 'order' => 532],
            ['start_time' => 1724.6, 'end_time' => 1725.66, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t even know this person.', 'source_text' => 'Anda langsung tidak mengenali insan tersebut.', 'order' => 533],
            ['start_time' => 1725.76, 'end_time' => 1727.1, 'target_text' => 'You spoiled their life.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda merosakkan masa depan hidupnya.', 'order' => 534],
            ['start_time' => 1727.2, 'end_time' => 1734.3, 'target_text' => 'You messed up their reputation and they are really good people and you don\'t know or you promoted someone who is who is not', 'source_text' => 'Anda mencemarkan maruah dan reputasinya sedangkan mereka orang yang amat baik, atau anda mempromosikan pempengaruh yang langsung', 'order' => 535],
            ['start_time' => 1734.4, 'end_time' => 1741.18, 'target_text' => 'worth promoting at all because of their behavior that does not live up to the morals and values that we align with.', 'source_text' => 'tidak layak dipromosikan disebabkan akhlaknya yang bercanggah dengan nilai dan syariat Islam yang kita pegang.', 'order' => 536],
            ['start_time' => 1741.28, 'end_time' => 1742.18, 'target_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'source_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'order' => 537],
            ['start_time' => 1742.28, 'end_time' => 1743.38, 'target_text' => 'So, what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Maka, apakah yang bakal berlaku?', 'order' => 538],
            ['start_time' => 1743.48, 'end_time' => 1746.62, 'target_text' => 'You see all these bad deeds pile up and pile up and pile up.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menyaksikan segala dosa keburukan itu bertimbun, bertimbun dan semakin menggunung.', 'order' => 539],
            ['start_time' => 1746.72, 'end_time' => 1747.7, 'target_text' => 'Then what\'s going to happen?', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian apakah yang akan terjadi seterusnya?', 'order' => 540],
            ['start_time' => 1747.8, 'end_time' => 1750.68, 'target_text' => 'All the good deeds are going to come.', 'source_text' => 'Segala amalan kebajikan pula akan dibawa masuk.', 'order' => 541],
            ['start_time' => 1764.28, 'end_time' => 1768.54, 'target_text' => 'Allah says on that day of Qiyamah, we will set the scales of justice.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman bahawa pada hari kiamat kelak, Kami akan menegakkan neraca-neraca keadilan yang mutlak.', 'order' => 542],
            ['start_time' => 1768.64, 'end_time' => 1770.26, 'target_text' => 'Nobody will be oppressed.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sesiapa pun yang akan dizalimi.', 'order' => 543],
            ['start_time' => 1770.36, 'end_time' => 1771.94, 'target_text' => 'No soul shall be wronged.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada satu jiwa pun yang akan dianiayai walau sedikit.', 'order' => 544],
            ['start_time' => 1772.04, 'end_time' => 1773.98, 'target_text' => 'Those are your deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Semua itu adalah rekod amalan anda sendiri.', 'order' => 545],
            ['start_time' => 1774.08, 'end_time' => 1775.18, 'target_text' => 'So, what\'s my duty?', 'source_text' => 'Maka, apakah kewajipan saya?', 'order' => 546],
            ['start_time' => 1775.28, 'end_time' => 1780.74, 'target_text' => 'I\'m sitting here in the Masjid in Abdeen trying to picture and we won\'t be able to picture it fully because we don\'t know,', 'source_text' => 'Saya duduk di sini di dalam masjid di Aberdeen cuba membayangkan — dan kita memang tidak mampu membayangkannya secara sempurna kerana kita belum melihatnya,', 'order' => 547],
            ['start_time' => 1780.84, 'end_time' => 1784.74, 'target_text' => 'but just picture for a human mind.', 'source_text' => 'tetapi sekadar gambaran akal fikiran manusia biasa.', 'order' => 548],
            ['start_time' => 1784.84, 'end_time' => 1785.58, 'target_text' => 'Here is my deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah lembaran amalan saya.', 'order' => 549],
            ['start_time' => 1785.68, 'end_time' => 1786.78, 'target_text' => 'There\'s all bad, all bad.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat begitu banyak keburukan, dosa demi dosa.', 'order' => 550],
            ['start_time' => 1786.88, 'end_time' => 1790.48, 'target_text' => 'Things I know, things I don\'t know because Allah says', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang saya sedari dan perkara yang saya sendiri terlupa, kerana Allah berfirman:', 'order' => 551],
            ['start_time' => 1794.28, 'end_time' => 1802.26, 'target_text' => 'whoever did even an a little mustard seeds weight worth of good will see it and the bad will also see it.', 'source_text' => 'sesiapa yang melakukan amalan kebaikan walau seberat biji sawi pasti akan melihat balasannya, dan sesiapa yang melakukan kejahatan pasti akan melihat balasannya juga.', 'order' => 552],
            ['start_time' => 1802.36, 'end_time' => 1803.86, 'target_text' => 'So, it\'s all getting there.', 'source_text' => 'Maka semuanya dihimpunkan di situ.', 'order' => 553],
            ['start_time' => 1803.96, 'end_time' => 1807.02, 'target_text' => 'Now, my good deeds start piling up and guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Kini, amalan kebajikan saya pula mula diletakkan di atas timbangan, dan tahukah anda apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 554],
            ['start_time' => 1807.12, 'end_time' => 1809.78, 'target_text' => 'There is still more bad than good and what am I doing?', 'source_text' => 'Timbangan dosa masih kelihatan lebih berat daripada timbangan pahala, dan apakah yang sedang saya lakukan pada waktu itu?', 'order' => 555],
            ['start_time' => 1809.88, 'end_time' => 1816.1, 'target_text' => 'I\'m holding my breath maybe and I\'m just seeing Wow, one, two, three and you\'re saying inshallah, inshallah, inshallah I make', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin saya sedang menahan nafas dengan penuh cemas sambil menyaksikan satu, dua, tiga amalan ditimbang, dan anda merintih, "Insya-Allah, insya-Allah moga aku selamat,', 'order' => 556],
            ['start_time' => 1816.2, 'end_time' => 1818.42, 'target_text' => 'it, inshallah I make it, inshallah I make it, inshallah I make it.', 'source_text' => 'moga aku berjaya, moga timbanganku melepasi, moga aku diselamatkan."', 'order' => 557],
            ['start_time' => 1818.52, 'end_time' => 1819.18, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 558],
            ['start_time' => 1819.28, 'end_time' => 1825.38, 'target_text' => 'It starts going and going down and down and meaning it\'s getting heavier and heavier and you\'re so happy and it\'s almost there', 'source_text' => 'Daun timbangan kanan mula bergerak turun dan semakin condong ke bawah, bermakna timbangan pahala semakin berat dan anda berasa begitu gembira kerana hampir-hampir melepasi,', 'order' => 559],
            ['start_time' => 1825.48, 'end_time' => 1828.26, 'target_text' => 'and you need a few MORE DEEDS AND GUESS WHAT ALLAH SAYS?', 'source_text' => 'dan anda memerlukan sedikit sahaja lagi amalan soleh, dan tahukah anda apa yang Allah firmankan?', 'order' => 560],
            ['start_time' => 1828.36, 'end_time' => 1836.06, 'target_text' => 'Allah says wallahi, if your right side tips the left, we will forget about the whole left and give you paradise.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: Demi kemuliaan-Ku, sekiranya timbangan sebelah kananmu mengatasi timbangan sebelah kirimu, Kami akan hapuskan seluruh dosa di sebelah kiri dan mengurniakan syurga kepadamu.', 'order' => 561],
            ['start_time' => 1836.16, 'end_time' => 1836.82, 'target_text' => 'How\'s that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pandangan anda tentang keluasan rahmat itu?', 'order' => 562],
            ['start_time' => 1836.92, 'end_time' => 1838.1, 'target_text' => 'Imagine the mercy of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan betapa agungnya rahmat Allah.', 'order' => 563],
            ['start_time' => 1838.2, 'end_time' => 1841.34, 'target_text' => 'Allah didn\'t say you have to be sin-free to go to Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak menetapkan bahawa anda wajib bebas sepenuhnya daripada dosa untuk melangkah masuk ke dalam syurga.', 'order' => 564],
            ['start_time' => 1841.44, 'end_time' => 1843.3, 'target_text' => 'Allah says,', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman,', 'order' => 565],
            ['start_time' => 1843.4, 'end_time' => 1845.2, 'target_text' => '"Whoever\'s', 'source_text' => '"Maka sesiapa yang', 'order' => 566],
            ['start_time' => 1849.48, 'end_time' => 1854.02, 'target_text' => 'good deeds are heavier, they are the ones who will be successful." So, you do have bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'berat timbangan kebaikannya, mereka itulah orang-orang yang beroleh kejayaan." Jadi, sememangnya anda pernah melakukan dosa.', 'order' => 567],
            ['start_time' => 1854.12, 'end_time' => 1855.14, 'target_text' => 'I have bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mempunyai dosa.', 'order' => 568],
            ['start_time' => 1855.24, 'end_time' => 1855.9, 'target_text' => 'You have bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Anda juga mempunyai dosa.', 'order' => 569],
            ['start_time' => 1856.0, 'end_time' => 1856.74, 'target_text' => 'But, guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Namun, tahukah anda apa kelebihannya?', 'order' => 570],
            ['start_time' => 1856.84, 'end_time' => 1859.74, 'target_text' => 'We have more good deeds than bad.', 'source_text' => 'Kita berusaha agar timbangan kebaikan kita mengatasi timbangan keburukan kita.', 'order' => 571],
            ['start_time' => 1859.84, 'end_time' => 1861.74, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah rahsia kejayaannya.', 'order' => 572],
            ['start_time' => 1861.84, 'end_time' => 1866.34, 'target_text' => 'And we seek the forgiveness of Allah to the best of our capacity for the bad.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita memohon keampunan daripada Allah mengikut sedaya upaya kemampuan kita atas segala kekhilafan lalu.', 'order' => 573],
            ['start_time' => 1866.44, 'end_time' => 1867.74, 'target_text' => 'And Allah will wipe it out.', 'source_text' => 'Maka Allah pasti akan memadamkan dosa-dosa tersebut.', 'order' => 574],
            ['start_time' => 1867.84, 'end_time' => 1871.58, 'target_text' => 'When you have more good deeds than bad, guess what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila timbangan amalan baik anda lebih berat daripada amalan buruk, tahukah anda apa yang bakal terjadi?', 'order' => 575],
            ['start_time' => 1871.68, 'end_time' => 1873.06, 'target_text' => 'You will be successful.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pasti akan beroleh kejayaan hakiki.', 'order' => 576],
            ['start_time' => 1873.16, 'end_time' => 1875.28, 'target_text' => 'At the', 'source_text' => 'Hadis Nabi', 'order' => 577],
            ['start_time' => 1877.84, 'end_time' => 1880.66, 'target_text' => 'Hadith says, "Follow up your bad deed with good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam bersabda, "Iringilah perbuatan burukmu dengan melakukan amalan kebajikan.', 'order' => 578],
            ['start_time' => 1880.76, 'end_time' => 1882.66, 'target_text' => 'It will be wiped out." Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Nescaya amalan kebajikan itu akan menghapuskan dosa keburukan tersebut." Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 579],
            ['start_time' => 1882.76, 'end_time' => 1883.5, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 580],
            ['start_time' => 1883.6, 'end_time' => 1886.02, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the mercy of Allah, the favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah tanda keluasan rahmat Allah dan kurniaan kasih sayang-Nya.', 'order' => 581],
            ['start_time' => 1886.12, 'end_time' => 1890.3, 'target_text' => 'So, I want to invite you today to do as many good deeds as you can.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, saya ingin mengajak anda semua pada malam ini untuk memperbanyakkan amalan soleh sebanyak mungkin mengikut daya kemampuan anda.', 'order' => 582],
            ['start_time' => 1890.4, 'end_time' => 1891.06, 'target_text' => 'You know why?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengapa?', 'order' => 583],
            ['start_time' => 1891.16, 'end_time' => 1895.26, 'target_text' => 'Hey, you and I have a lot of bad deeds we\'re not proud of.', 'source_text' => 'Ketahuilah, anda dan saya mempunyai banyak dosa silam yang langsung tidak membanggakan kita.', 'order' => 584],
            ['start_time' => 1895.36, 'end_time' => 1897.98, 'target_text' => 'You and I have a lot of bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Anda dan saya memiliki banyak kesilapan lampau.', 'order' => 585],
            ['start_time' => 1898.08, 'end_time' => 1901.7, 'target_text' => 'We would be embarrassed if the people had to see what we\'ve done in our lives.', 'source_text' => 'Kita pasti akan berasa teramat malu sekiranya orang ramai dapat melihat apa yang pernah kita lakukan sepanjang hidup kita.', 'order' => 586],
            ['start_time' => 1901.8, 'end_time' => 1902.38, 'target_text' => 'Do you agree?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda bersetuju dengan saya?', 'order' => 587],
            ['start_time' => 1902.48, 'end_time' => 1903.38, 'target_text' => 'All of us.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua mengakuinya.', 'order' => 588],
            ['start_time' => 1903.48, 'end_time' => 1905.42, 'target_text' => 'We have so many secrets.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua menyimpan begitu banyak rahsia.', 'order' => 589],
            ['start_time' => 1905.52, 'end_time' => 1907.3, 'target_text' => 'We have so many secrets.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mempunyai terlalu banyak rahsia aib yang tersembunyi.', 'order' => 590],
            ['start_time' => 1907.4, 'end_time' => 1911.22, 'target_text' => 'If Allah was not merciful, he would expose us.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya Allah tidak bersifat Maha Pengasih dan Menutup Aib, nescaya Dia telah mendedahkan keaiban kita kepada khalayak ramai.', 'order' => 591],
            ['start_time' => 1911.32, 'end_time' => 1913.34, 'target_text' => 'Sorry, I\'m not trying to say I\'m a bad guy.', 'source_text' => 'Maafkan saya, bukanlah niat saya hendak mengatakan bahawa saya seorang yang jahat.', 'order' => 592],
            ['start_time' => 1913.44, 'end_time' => 1916.34, 'target_text' => 'But, what I am trying to say is we all have sins.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apa yang ingin saya tekankan adalah hakikat bahawa kita semua insan yang pernah berdosa.', 'order' => 593],
            ['start_time' => 1916.44, 'end_time' => 1916.9, 'target_text' => 'We are sinful.', 'source_text' => 'Kita ini manusia yang lemah.', 'order' => 594],
            ['start_time' => 1917.0, 'end_time' => 1917.74, 'target_text' => 'We are Banu Adam.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah anak-cucu Nabi Adam.', 'order' => 595],
            ['start_time' => 1917.84, 'end_time' => 1919.74, 'target_text' => 'We are Bashar.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah manusia biasa yang tidak maksum.', 'order' => 596],
            ['start_time' => 1919.84, 'end_time' => 1924.82, 'target_text' => 'How many of us has have slept over prayer sometimes because of whatever the reason may be?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai antara kita yang pernah terlepas waktu solat kerana terlajak tidur disebabkan kepenatan atau apa jua punca?', 'order' => 597],
            ['start_time' => 1924.92, 'end_time' => 1926.66, 'target_text' => 'May Allah never let that happen to us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah tidak membiarkan perkara sedemikian berlaku lagi kepada kita.', 'order' => 598],
            ['start_time' => 1926.76, 'end_time' => 1929.02, 'target_text' => 'But, it\'s such a heavy feeling.', 'source_text' => 'Namun ia mendatangkan rasa bersalah yang amat berat di dalam jiwa.', 'order' => 599],
            ['start_time' => 1929.12, 'end_time' => 1934.94, 'target_text' => 'The bonus is the Hadith says, "Man nama an salatin aw nasiya fa yusalliha idha dhakaraha."', 'source_text' => 'Berita gembiranya adalah hadis Baginda bersabda, "Man nama \'an salatin aw nasiyaha falyusalliha idha dhakaraha — sesiapa yang tertidur daripada solat atau terlupa, maka solatlah sebaik sahaja dia teringat."', 'order' => 600],
            ['start_time' => 1935.04, 'end_time' => 1936.22, 'target_text' => 'Hadith correct narration.', 'source_text' => 'Riwayat hadis sahih.', 'order' => 601],
            ['start_time' => 1936.32, 'end_time' => 1942.02, 'target_text' => 'The Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam says, "Whoever sleeps over a prayer or whoever has forgotten sometimes forgetfulness."', 'source_text' => 'Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam bersabda, "Sesiapa yang tertidur daripada menunaikan solat atau terlupa — kadangkala sifat lupa itu manusiawi."', 'order' => 602],
            ['start_time' => 1942.12, 'end_time' => 1949.54, 'target_text' => 'Here in Abdeen, one of the negatives is in some of the seasons of the year, your prayers are in awkward times, on awkward', 'source_text' => 'Di sini di Aberdeen, antara cabarannya adalah pada sesetengah musim dalam setahun, waktu solat anda berada pada waktu yang agak janggal, waktu yang', 'order' => 603],
            ['start_time' => 1949.64, 'end_time' => 1950.94, 'target_text' => 'time, not easy.', 'source_text' => 'mencabar dan bukan mudah.', 'order' => 604],
            ['start_time' => 1951.04, 'end_time' => 1955.34, 'target_text' => 'You got to do Fajr, then you got to do Dhuhr, and then you don\'t know when Asr just came in and went.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu menunaikan solat Subuh, kemudian Zohor, dan selepas itu anda tidak perasan bila waktu Asar masuk dan berlalu pergi.', 'order' => 605],
            ['start_time' => 1955.44, 'end_time' => 1960.06, 'target_text' => 'And before you know it, it\'s Maghrib, and after that it\'s Maghrib and Isha, you\'re confused whether it\'s the same time or', 'source_text' => 'Dan sebelum anda sedar, waktu Maghrib telah masuk, dan sejurus selepas itu waktu Maghrib dan Isyak bertindih sehingga anda keliru sama ada ia waktu yang sama atau', 'order' => 606],
            ['start_time' => 1960.16, 'end_time' => 1961.06, 'target_text' => 'not the same time.', 'source_text' => 'bukan waktu yang sama.', 'order' => 607],
            ['start_time' => 1961.16, 'end_time' => 1965.54, 'target_text' => 'Some scholars would say you can read these two together and so so much of chaos and confusion.', 'source_text' => 'Sesetengah ulama berfatwa bahawa anda boleh menjamakkan kedua-dua solat ini, menimbulkan pelbagai kekeliruan dan tanda tanya.', 'order' => 608],
            ['start_time' => 1965.64, 'end_time' => 1966.42, 'target_text' => 'How do we do that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah cara untuk kita menghadapinya?', 'order' => 609],
            ['start_time' => 1966.52, 'end_time' => 1971.34, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, we do our best and we ask Allah to accept it and we ask Allah to forgive our shortcoming.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, kita berusaha melakukan yang terbaik semampu kita, dan kita memohon agar Allah menerimanya serta mengampunkan segala kekurangan kita.', 'order' => 610],
            ['start_time' => 1971.44, 'end_time' => 1976.38, 'target_text' => 'So, because I have bad deeds and I want the tipping of the scale on the right side, how do I start?', 'source_text' => 'Maka, oleh kerana saya memiliki dosa dan saya mendambakan timbangan neraca menjadi berat di sebelah kanan, bagaimanakah harus saya bermula?', 'order' => 611],
            ['start_time' => 1976.48, 'end_time' => 1977.38, 'target_text' => 'I teach you something.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin mengajar anda suatu amalan.', 'order' => 612],
            ['start_time' => 1977.48, 'end_time' => 1980.98, 'target_text' => 'You start off by seeking the forgiveness of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Mulakanlah langkah anda dengan memohon keampunan daripada Allah (beristighfar).', 'order' => 613],
            ['start_time' => 1981.08, 'end_time' => 1986.98, 'target_text' => 'I once gave a talk at a school to some youngsters and I told them, teenagers, I said start off by seeking the forgiveness', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah menyampaikan ceramah di sebuah sekolah kepada sekumpulan anak muda, para remaja, dan saya menasihati mereka agar memulakan langkah dengan memohon keampunan', 'order' => 614],
            ['start_time' => 1987.08, 'end_time' => 1987.78, 'target_text' => 'of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'daripada Allah.', 'order' => 615],
            ['start_time' => 1987.88, 'end_time' => 1989.06, 'target_text' => 'They said, we haven\'t sinned.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menjawab, "Kami belum pernah berbuat dosa.', 'order' => 616],
            ['start_time' => 1989.16, 'end_time' => 1990.22, 'target_text' => 'Why should we seek forgiveness?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa pula kami perlu memohon keampunan?"', 'order' => 617],
            ['start_time' => 1990.32, 'end_time' => 1992.86, 'target_text' => 'I\'m like, Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Saya terkejut, "Allahu Akbar."', 'order' => 618],
            ['start_time' => 1992.96, 'end_time' => 1994.42, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar, we haven\'t sinned.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar, \'kami belum pernah berbuat dosa\'.', 'order' => 619],
            ['start_time' => 1994.52, 'end_time' => 1996.3, 'target_text' => 'Why should I seek forgiveness?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa pula saya perlu memohon keampunan?', 'order' => 620],
            ['start_time' => 1996.4, 'end_time' => 1997.82, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, we seek forgiveness.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, kita semua wajib sentiasa beristighfar.', 'order' => 621],
            ['start_time' => 1997.92, 'end_time' => 2000.62, 'target_text' => 'Do you know how you seek forgiveness?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda bagaimana cara terbaik untuk memohon keampunan?', 'order' => 622],
            ['start_time' => 2000.72, 'end_time' => 2007.74, 'target_text' => 'Oh Allah, forgive me for the sins I know, the sins I don\'t know, the minor sins, the major sins, those I remember, those I', 'source_text' => '"Ya Allah, ampunkanlah dosa-dosa yang aku ketahui, dosa-dosa yang tidak aku ketahui, dosa kecil mahupun dosa besar, dosa yang aku ingat mahupun yang', 'order' => 623],
            ['start_time' => 2007.84, 'end_time' => 2013.98, 'target_text' => 'don\'t remember, those I know I was committing a sin and those I committed without even realizing I was committing a sin.', 'source_text' => 'aku terlupa, dosa yang aku sedari semasa melakukannya serta dosa yang aku lakukan tanpa aku sedar bahawa aku sedang melakukan maksiat."', 'order' => 624],
            ['start_time' => 2014.08, 'end_time' => 2014.9, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 625],
            ['start_time' => 2015.0, 'end_time' => 2016.96, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 626],
            ['start_time' => 2017.16, 'end_time' => 2017.7, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 627],
            ['start_time' => 2017.8, 'end_time' => 2020.78, 'target_text' => 'Oh Allah, I seek your forgiveness for that which I don\'t even know.', 'source_text' => 'Ya Allah, aku memohon keampunan-Mu atas apa jua dosa yang langsung tidak aku ketahui.', 'order' => 628],
            ['start_time' => 2020.88, 'end_time' => 2022.9, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t even realize.', 'source_text' => 'Yang langsung tidak aku sedari.', 'order' => 629],
            ['start_time' => 2023.0, 'end_time' => 2028.98, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes nowadays, you know how pressurizing the environment may be, you\'re walking on the street and you don\'t even know,', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala pada zaman ini, anda tahu betapa besarnya godaan persekitaran di luar sana, anda sedang berjalan di jalanan dan tanpa anda sedari,', 'order' => 630],
            ['start_time' => 2029.08, 'end_time' => 2033.58, 'target_text' => 'I look this way, I look that way, I look that way, you know, I saw something I wasn\'t supposed to see.', 'source_text' => 'saya memandang ke kanan, memandang ke kiri, memandang ke hadapan, dan saya terlihat sesuatu yang tidak sepatutnya saya lihat.', 'order' => 631],
            ['start_time' => 2033.68, 'end_time' => 2034.1, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang berlaku selepas itu?', 'order' => 632],
            ['start_time' => 2034.2, 'end_time' => 2035.02, 'target_text' => 'You just carried on moving.', 'source_text' => 'Anda teruskan sahaja berjalan.', 'order' => 633],
            ['start_time' => 2035.12, 'end_time' => 2036.62, 'target_text' => 'Did you ever say Astaghfirullah?', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah anda spontan beristighfar melafazkan Astaghfirullah?', 'order' => 634],
            ['start_time' => 2036.72, 'end_time' => 2037.22, 'target_text' => 'No, I didn\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, saya tidak mengucapkannya.', 'order' => 635],
            ['start_time' => 2037.32, 'end_time' => 2037.43, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 636],
            ['start_time' => 2037.48, 'end_time' => 2039.7, 'target_text' => 'Because everyone walks, everyone sees.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana semua orang berjalan dan semua orang melihat perkara yang sama.', 'order' => 637],
            ['start_time' => 2039.8, 'end_time' => 2044.06, 'target_text' => 'And some people, you know, when they they fear Allah, they look and they say Astaghfirullah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sesetengah insan, apabila mereka mempunyai rasa takut kepada Allah, mereka terpandang lalu segera beristighfar, "Astaghfirullah."', 'order' => 638],
            ['start_time' => 2044.16, 'end_time' => 2045.54, 'target_text' => 'Look down.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 639],
            ['start_time' => 2045.64, 'end_time' => 2048.9, 'target_text' => 'A little bit more intelligent, they look there, they say La hawla wala quwwata illa billah.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi yang lebih peka, apabila terpandang mereka melafazkan, "La hawla wala quwwata illa billah."', 'order' => 640],
            ['start_time' => 2049.0, 'end_time' => 2050.7, 'target_text' => 'They look down.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 641],
            ['start_time' => 2050.8, 'end_time' => 2053.74, 'target_text' => 'And the one who\'s even more intelligent, he looks and he says In sha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan bagi yang jauh lebih cerdik, dia terpandang lalu berkata, "Insya-Allah."', 'order' => 642],
            ['start_time' => 2053.84, 'end_time' => 2054.86, 'target_text' => 'He looks down.', 'source_text' => 'Dia menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 643],
            ['start_time' => 2054.96, 'end_time' => 2055.62, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'order' => 644],
            ['start_time' => 2055.72, 'end_time' => 2057.579, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 645],
            ['start_time' => 2057.679, 'end_time' => 2059.46, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 646],
            ['start_time' => 2059.56, 'end_time' => 2062.819, 'target_text' => 'I hope that In sha Allah is for something halal, not haram.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berharap ucapan \'Insya-Allah\' itu adalah untuk perkara yang halal, bukannya perkara yang haram.', 'order' => 647],
            ['start_time' => 2062.919, 'end_time' => 2063.539, 'target_text' => 'Right?', 'source_text' => 'Betul bukan?', 'order' => 648],
            ['start_time' => 2063.639, 'end_time' => 2065.22, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah merahmati anda semua.', 'order' => 649],
            ['start_time' => 2065.32, 'end_time' => 2067.18, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa melimpahkan barakah kepada anda.', 'order' => 650],
            ['start_time' => 2067.28, 'end_time' => 2072.819, 'target_text' => 'But nonetheless, on a more serious note, sometimes the point I\'m raising is sometimes we don\'t even realize that we might', 'source_text' => 'Namun apa pun, kembali kepada nada yang lebih serius, intipati yang ingin saya ketengahkan adalah kadangkala kita sendiri tidak menyedari bahawa kita mungkin', 'order' => 651],
            ['start_time' => 2072.919, 'end_time' => 2075.7, 'target_text' => 'have committed a minor sin and we don\'t realize it sometimes.', 'source_text' => 'telah terlanjur melakukan dosa kecil tanpa kita sedari.', 'order' => 652],
            ['start_time' => 2075.8, 'end_time' => 2079.46, 'target_text' => 'Say ask Allah, oh Allah forgive me for that which I know, that which I don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Ucapkanlah dan mohonlah kepada Allah, "Ya Allah, ampunkanlah daku atas apa yang aku ketahui dan apa yang tidak aku ketahui."', 'order' => 653],
            ['start_time' => 2079.56, 'end_time' => 2083.22, 'target_text' => 'When you seek forgiveness of Allah, learn to become humble.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda memohon keampunan daripada Allah, belajarlah untuk menjadi insan yang tawaduk dan rendah diri.', 'order' => 654],
            ['start_time' => 2083.32, 'end_time' => 2084.539, 'target_text' => 'Learn to become humble.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah merendahkan ego.', 'order' => 655],
            ['start_time' => 2084.639, 'end_time' => 2095.26, 'target_text' => 'Your power, your authority, your money, your fame and popularity, your good looks, none of that means anything in the eyes', 'source_text' => 'Kuasa anda, darjat jawatan anda, wang ringgit anda, kemasyhuran dan populariti anda, ketampanan atau kecantikan paras rupa anda — tiada satu pun daripadanya bernilai di sisi', 'order' => 656],
            ['start_time' => 2095.36, 'end_time' => 2097.28, 'target_text' => 'of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Allah.', 'order' => 657],
            ['start_time' => 2104.32, 'end_time' => 2107.86, 'target_text' => 'Allah doesn\'t look at those material items and those external things.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak sesekali memandang kepada kebendaan duniawi dan perkara luaran tersebut.', 'order' => 658],
            ['start_time' => 2107.96, 'end_time' => 2110.5, 'target_text' => 'He doesn\'t look at your bodies, your shapes, how you look, etc.', 'source_text' => 'Dia tidak memandang kepada rupa jasad anda, bentuk tubuh anda, bagaimana penampilan luaran anda dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 659],
            ['start_time' => 2110.6, 'end_time' => 2111.26, 'target_text' => 'etc.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 660],
            ['start_time' => 2111.36, 'end_time' => 2115.02, 'target_text' => 'Allah looks at the heart and Allah looks at your deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Allah memandang kepada keikhlasan hati kamu dan Allah memandang kepada amalan perbuatan kamu.', 'order' => 661],
            ['start_time' => 2115.12, 'end_time' => 2120.78, 'target_text' => 'And when we say Allah looks at the heart, Shaitan comes and keeps on telling you Allah looks at the heart.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila kita menyebut bahawa Allah memandang kepada hati, Syaitan mula datang berbisik dan sentiasa menanam fikiran bahawa \'Allah hanya memandang kepada hati\'.', 'order' => 662],
            ['start_time' => 2120.88, 'end_time' => 2122.02, 'target_text' => 'You might wonder, so?', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin tertanya-tanya, apa salahnya?', 'order' => 663],
            ['start_time' => 2122.12, 'end_time' => 2123.62, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a true statement.', 'source_text' => 'Itu kenyataan yang benar.', 'order' => 664],
            ['start_time' => 2123.72, 'end_time' => 2125.94, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a true statement, but Shaitan is too clever.', 'source_text' => 'Ia memang kenyataan yang benar, namun Syaitan itu teramat licik tipu dayanya.', 'order' => 665],
            ['start_time' => 2126.04, 'end_time' => 2126.82, 'target_text' => 'You know what he does?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa helah jarumnya?', 'order' => 666],
            ['start_time' => 2126.92, 'end_time' => 2130.18, 'target_text' => 'He says, hey, Allah doesn\'t look at your body or soul or anything.', 'source_text' => 'Dia berbisik, "Hei, Allah kan tidak memandang kepada rupa tubuh kamu, pakaian kamu atau apa-apa pun.', 'order' => 667],
            ['start_time' => 2130.28, 'end_time' => 2131.82, 'target_text' => 'He looks at your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Dia hanya memandang kepada hatimu semata-mata."', 'order' => 668],
            ['start_time' => 2131.92, 'end_time' => 2133.5, 'target_text' => 'And he keeps on saying he looks at your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dia terus-menerus mengulangi bahawa Allah hanya melihat hatimu.', 'order' => 669],
            ['start_time' => 2133.6, 'end_time' => 2138.98, 'target_text' => 'So you start sinning and when someone advises you, you say,', 'source_text' => 'Lalu anda mula berani melakukan maksiat, dan apabila seseorang menegur dan menasihati anda, anda terus membalas,', 'order' => 670],
            ['start_time' => 2139.08, 'end_time' => 2139.5, 'target_text' => 'keep quiet.', 'source_text' => '"Diamlah kamu.', 'order' => 671],
            ['start_time' => 2139.6, 'end_time' => 2141.66, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows my heart.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tahu apa yang ada dalam hati saya!"', 'order' => 672],
            ['start_time' => 2141.76, 'end_time' => 2142.98, 'target_text' => 'Where did you get that from?', 'source_text' => 'Dari mana anda belajar jawapan sebegitu?', 'order' => 673],
            ['start_time' => 2143.08, 'end_time' => 2144.58, 'target_text' => 'Shaitan, who else?', 'source_text' => 'Daripada Syaitan, siapa lagi?', 'order' => 674],
            ['start_time' => 2144.68, 'end_time' => 2148.26, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s a kalimatu haqqin urida biha batil.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana itu adalah \'kalimatu haqqin urida bihal batil\' — kalimah yang benar tetapi digunakan dengan niat yang batil dan salah.', 'order' => 675],
            ['start_time' => 2148.36, 'end_time' => 2152.86, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a true statement, but your intention is false.', 'source_text' => 'Ia kenyataan yang benar, tetapi niat anda menggunakannya adalah batil semata-mata untuk membela kemungkaran.', 'order' => 676],
            ['start_time' => 2152.96, 'end_time' => 2157.98, 'target_text' => 'Is it not my duty to advise you, my beloved sister, my beloved brother?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah suatu kewajipan bagi saya untuk menasihati anda, wahai saudariku yang dikasihi, wahai saudaraku yang dikasihi?', 'order' => 677],
            ['start_time' => 2158.08, 'end_time' => 2159.94, 'target_text' => 'We need to learn to dress appropriately.', 'source_text' => 'Kita perlu belajar menutup aurat dan berpakaian dengan sopan mengikut syariat.', 'order' => 678],
            ['start_time' => 2160.04, 'end_time' => 2162.34, 'target_text' => 'Notice how I added the brothers in.', 'source_text' => 'Perhatikan bagaimana saya turut menyertakan kaum lelaki sekali.', 'order' => 679],
            ['start_time' => 2162.44, 'end_time' => 2165.34, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s very unfair to just single the sisters out.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana amat tidak adil sekiranya kita hanya menuding jari dan menegur kaum wanita sahaja.', 'order' => 680],
            ['start_time' => 2165.44, 'end_time' => 2167.1, 'target_text' => 'No, we are all guilty.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, kita semua juga ada melakukan kesilapan.', 'order' => 681],
            ['start_time' => 2167.2, 'end_time' => 2173.1, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes some of the brothers wear clothing that is more embarrassing than all the sisters put together.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala sebahagian kaum lelaki memakai pakaian yang jauh lebih memalukan daripada gabungan pakaian seluruh kaum wanita.', 'order' => 682],
            ['start_time' => 2173.2, 'end_time' => 2175.68, 'target_text' => 'Because you come to the masjid', 'source_text' => 'Kerana anda datang melangkah ke masjid,', 'order' => 683],
            ['start_time' => 2176.0, 'end_time' => 2180.28, 'target_text' => 'wala hawla wala quwwata illa billah, you go in sujud.', 'source_text' => 'wala hawla wala quwwata illa billah, lalu anda tunduk bersujud.', 'order' => 684],
            ['start_time' => 2180.64, 'end_time' => 2183.5, 'target_text' => 'See, already people are saying hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakil.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah, jemaah sudah mula mengeluh melafazkan hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakil.', 'order' => 685],
            ['start_time' => 2183.6, 'end_time' => 2185.14, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 686],
            ['start_time' => 2185.24, 'end_time' => 2186.78, 'target_text' => 'Bro,', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudaraku,', 'order' => 687],
            ['start_time' => 2186.88, 'end_time' => 2190.68, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t even want to use the word crack in the masjid.', 'source_text' => 'saya sendiri tidak sanggup hendak menyebut perkataan terdedah bahagian punggung di dalam masjid yang mulia ini.', 'order' => 688],
            ['start_time' => 2191.12, 'end_time' => 2196.22, 'target_text' => 'But you and I know that it is so embarrassing AND NO ONE TALKS ABOUT THE MEN.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda dan saya sedar betapa mengaibkan keadaan itu, TETAPI TIADA SESIAPA PUN YANG BERANI MENEGUR KAUM LELAKI.', 'order' => 689],
            ['start_time' => 2196.32, 'end_time' => 2198.62, 'target_text' => 'MY BROTHER, YOU NEED TO dress appropriately.', 'source_text' => 'WAHAI SAUDARAKU, ANDA WAJIB berpakaian dengan sopan dan menutup aurat dengan sempurna.', 'order' => 690],
            ['start_time' => 2198.72, 'end_time' => 2200.74, 'target_text' => 'You need to watch out your dress code.', 'source_text' => 'Anda wajib menjaga etika pemakaian anda.', 'order' => 691],
            ['start_time' => 2200.84, 'end_time' => 2202.5, 'target_text' => 'You busy worried about all the sisters.', 'source_text' => 'Anda terlalu sibuk menegur aurat kaum wanita.', 'order' => 692],
            ['start_time' => 2202.6, 'end_time' => 2205.78, 'target_text' => 'Yes, we are, but we are worried about the brothers and the sisters.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, kita perlu saling mengingatkan, tetapi kita wajib mengambil berat aurat kedua-duanya — kaum lelaki mahupun kaum wanita.', 'order' => 693],
            ['start_time' => 2205.88, 'end_time' => 2208.14, 'target_text' => 'We are worried about everyone, myself included.', 'source_text' => 'Kita wajib prihatin terhadap semua orang, termasuklah diri saya sendiri.', 'order' => 694],
            ['start_time' => 2208.24, 'end_time' => 2210.26, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m wrong, correct me.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya silap, tegurlah saya.', 'order' => 695],
            ['start_time' => 2210.36, 'end_time' => 2211.22, 'target_text' => 'I deserve it.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berhak menerima teguran itu.', 'order' => 696],
            ['start_time' => 2211.32, 'end_time' => 2216.02, 'target_text' => 'If I feel bad because I\'m corrected, I\'m going nowhere.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya berasa tersinggung semata-mata kerana ditegur, saya tidak akan ke mana-mana.', 'order' => 697],
            ['start_time' => 2216.12, 'end_time' => 2221.54, 'target_text' => 'If you are a person who feels bad when someone corrects you, you are going nowhere in life.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda jenis manusia yang cepat melatah dan terasa hati apabila seseorang menegur anda, anda tidak akan berjaya dalam hidup.', 'order' => 698],
            ['start_time' => 2221.64, 'end_time' => 2226.38, 'target_text' => 'If they were right and you were wrong, wallahi, that\'s there are chances that you may fail.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya teguran mereka itu benar dan anda yang silap, wallahi, ada kemungkinan besar anda akan kecundang.', 'order' => 699],
            ['start_time' => 2226.48, 'end_time' => 2231.62, 'target_text' => 'Imagine you\'re saying 1 + 1 is 3 and you\'re spending your life saying that one guy comes to you, "Habibi, let me tell you', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan sekiranya anda berkeras mengatakan bahawa 1 + 1 adalah 3 dan anda menghabiskan usia menegakkan kepalsuan itu, lalu seseorang datang menegur, "Habibi, mari saya terangkan', 'order' => 700],
            ['start_time' => 2231.72, 'end_time' => 2235.38, 'target_text' => 'it\'s two." Allah knows my heart.', 'source_text' => 'jawapannya adalah dua." Lalu anda menjawab, "Allah tahu apa yang ada dalam hati saya!"', 'order' => 701],
            ['start_time' => 2235.48, 'end_time' => 2236.54, 'target_text' => 'How can you say that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana anda boleh memberi alasan sebegitu?', 'order' => 702],
            ['start_time' => 2236.64, 'end_time' => 2237.54, 'target_text' => 'I\'m just telling you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sekadar berterus-terang kepada anda.', 'order' => 703],
            ['start_time' => 2237.64, 'end_time' => 2243.62, 'target_text' => 'So, now when you write your examination, 1 + 1 is 3, you must write at the bottom, "Allah knows my heart." No matter how many', 'source_text' => 'Maka sekarang, apabila anda menduduki peperiksaan dan menulis 1 + 1 = 3, anda menulis di bahagian bawah kertas jawapan, "Allah tahu isi hati saya." Walau berapa kali pun', 'order' => 704],
            ['start_time' => 2243.72, 'end_time' => 2246.46, 'target_text' => 'times you write that, you will be marked wrong.', 'source_text' => 'anda menulis nota sebegitu, jawapan anda tetap akan dipangkah salah.', 'order' => 705],
            ['start_time' => 2246.56, 'end_time' => 2248.1, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what we are doing in our lives.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sebenarnya apa yang sedang kita lakukan dalam kehidupan kita seharian.', 'order' => 706],
            ['start_time' => 2248.2, 'end_time' => 2249.14, 'target_text' => 'Someone tells you, "You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila seseorang menasihati anda, "Tahukah kamu?', 'order' => 707],
            ['start_time' => 2249.24, 'end_time' => 2250.62, 'target_text' => 'This is haram." What do you mean it\'s haram?', 'source_text' => 'Perkara ini adalah haram." Anda menjawab, "Apa maksud kamu ia haram?', 'order' => 708],
            ['start_time' => 2250.72, 'end_time' => 2251.5, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows my heart.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tahu apa yang ada dalam hati saya!"', 'order' => 709],
            ['start_time' => 2251.6, 'end_time' => 2253.58, 'target_text' => 'So, we\'re eating pork, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, kita makan daging babi, lalu berkata \'Allah tahu isi hati saya\'.', 'order' => 710],
